{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T07:50:12.942+00:00", "event": "llm.response", "session_id": "sess_7994abaa-2724-4e83-a482-eb82413fbec2", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_response": "{\n  \"elements\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"TEXT\",\n      \"source_task_ids\": [\n        \"task_1\",\n        \"task_2\"\n      ],\n      \"context_text\": \"\",\n      \"answer\": \"If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App by signing in, tapping \\\"View & Manage Card\\\" on the card overview screen, and selecting \\\"Freeze Card\\\". For a lost or stolen card, first freeze it and then request a replacement by logging into the Horizon App, opening the card dashboard, choosing \\\"View & Manage Card\\\", and tapping \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement\\\". Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one. Please note that the new card will arrive with a different card number, so be sure to update any recurring payments, such as subscriptions, with the new details. For changing your address, Singapore citizens and Permanent Residents must submit modifications through Singpass: sign in to Singpass and choose your language, verify that the details entered in your Horizon Bank application are accurate before proceeding, and submit the request. ICA will mail a {{faq_6e2d941d_006}}-digit PIN to your new residence, which typically arrives within one week for local addresses, and you can then use the PIN to continue your Horizon Bank onboarding via the ICA e-Service portal. Non-Singapore residents can update their residential or mailing address by accessing the myTax Portal with Singpass or a Singpass Foreign Account (SFA) and selecting \\\"Update Contact Details\\\" (reflecting within three business days), or by going to the Ministry of Manpower (MoM) website, logging in for EP Online with Singpass under the pass-holder section, choosing \\\"Change Particulars – Personal Contact Details and Residential Address of Pass Holder,\\\" inputting your Main Pass ID, and editing and saving the residential postal address.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"clarification\": \"\"\n}", "elapsed_ms": 2156.09}
