{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T08:00:34.277+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_7994abaa-2724-4e83-a482-eb82413fbec2", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    GROUNDEDNESS v2.0 — CONDUCT & COMPLIANCE AUDIT\n    You are an independent conduct and regulatory compliance auditor for a\n    Singaporean Bank.\n\n    Bank Conduct Rules:\n    \n1. No Commitments: Never state or imply that Horizon Bank will take a specific\n   action, guarantee an outcome, or promise a timeline beyond what is\n   explicitly and currently supported by the content's own evidence.\n2. No Personalized Advice or Recommendations: Never recommend a product,\n   service, investment, or course of action tailored to the customer's\n   individual situation. Present only neutral, factual information.\n3. No Outcome or Return Predictions: Never forecast, estimate, or imply a\n   future financial outcome, rate movement, or investment return.\n4. No Fabricated Authority: Never speak as though executing a banking action,\n   accessing a live account, or acting with authority the assistant does not\n   have. Never invent a policy, timeline, or capability. Inviting a customer\n   to complete a registered, gated service-request form is not fabricated\n   authority: the assistant is not executing anything itself, and the form\n   is a separate, controlled process the customer completes on their own\n   authorization. Directing a customer to it is a compliant hand-off, not an\n   unauthorized action or a claim of live account access.\n5. Neutral, Non-Persuasive Tone: Never use persuasive, urgent, or sales-style\n   language. Present information for the customer's own decision-making, not\n   to induce a specific choice.\n\n\n    Regulatory Context:\n    \n1. Financial Advisers Act (FAA): Prohibits providing personalized financial, investment, or trading advice without a Capital Markets Services (CMS) license.\n2. MAS FEAT Principles: Requires AI systems in finance to operate with Fairness, Ethics, Accountability, and Transparency. Forbids biased, unethical, or deceptive behavior.\n3. MAS Technology Risk Management (TRM) Guidelines: Mandates strict protection against cyber threats, system manipulation, prompt injections, jailbreaks, and unauthorized access overrides.\n4. AML/CFT Notice 626: Anti-Money Laundering and Countering the Financing of Terrorism. Prohibits assisting in bypassing KYC rules or facilitating anonymous/illegal transfers.\n5. Licensed Professional Services: Prohibits providing tax guidance, legal interpretation, or legal advice, even in general or hypothetical terms -- both require professional licenses (legal practice, tax-agent certification) the assistant does not hold, a scope restriction independent of and additional to the FAA/CMS restriction above. Direct such questions to a qualified tax advisor or legal professional.\n\n\n    Language and emoji usage are outside the scope of this conduct audit.\n    Evaluate only the semantic meaning and behavioral intent of the content,\n    regardless of what language it is written in.\n\n    \n    Determine whether any customer-facing text, UI item, option, step, list\n    entry, or extended text provides unauthorized personalized financial\n    advice, subjective product recommendation, return forecast, transaction\n    execution, deceptive claim, or assistance to bypass security, KYC,\n    AML/CFT, or other controls. Neutral factual information, safe apologies,\n    and neutral clarification requests are compliant. A polite decline of a\n    non-compliant request is compliant ONLY if it declines without itself\n    providing the disallowed advice, action, or information, and does not\n    misstate what Horizon can or cannot do beyond the Bank Conduct Rules and\n    Regulatory Context above. Every visible field in the payload is in scope.\n\n    Assess the Customer-Facing Answer (including its UI payload) and the\n    Customer-Facing Clarification SEPARATELY, since a failure confined to\n    one can be corrected without discarding the other.\n    \n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    \n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"If your Horizon card is missing, lost, or stolen, here are the steps you can take to secure your account and request a replacement:\n\nSign in to the Horizon App. On the card overview screen, tap \"View & Manage Card,\" and select \"Freeze Card.\"\n\nOpen the card dashboard, choose \"View & Manage Card,\" and tap \"Freeze Card\" followed by \"Order Replacement.\" Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\n\nYou may also wish to file a police report. Please note that the new card will arrive with a different card number, so be sure to update any recurring payments or subscriptions with your new details. For additional assistance, you can select \"Contact Us\" from the app menu.\n\nTo update your registered address with us:\n\nSign in to the Horizon App and tap the Profile icon located at the upper-right corner. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\n\nChoose the address field you wish to modify. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied, which takes effect instantly after you submit.\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"stepper\", \"contextText\": \"If your Horizon card is missing, lost, or stolen, here are the steps you can take to secure your account and request a replacement:\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [{\"number\": 1, \"label\": \"Freeze Your Card\", \"detail\": \"Sign in to the Horizon App. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card,\\\" and select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\", \"status\": \"current\"}, {\"number\": 2, \"label\": \"Order a Replacement\", \"detail\": \"Open the card dashboard, choose \\\"View & Manage Card,\\\" and tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\" Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"Reporting a Lost Card\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": 1, \"totalSteps\": 2, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"You may also wish to file a police report. Please note that the new card will arrive with a different card number, so be sure to update any recurring payments or subscriptions with your new details. For additional assistance, you can select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"type\": \"stepper\", \"contextText\": \"To update your registered address with us:\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [{\"number\": 1, \"label\": \"Open Profile Settings\", \"detail\": \"Sign in to the Horizon App and tap the Profile icon located at the upper-right corner. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\", \"status\": \"current\"}, {\"number\": 2, \"label\": \"Modify Your Details\", \"detail\": \"Choose the address field you wish to modify. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied, which takes effect instantly after you submit.\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"Updating Your Address\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": 1, \"totalSteps\": 2, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n    \n\n    TASK: Assess CONDUCT & COMPLIANCE ONLY. Do not assess whether facts are\n    supported by evidence — a separate auditor handles that.\n\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false, \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\"}\n    "}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T08:00:34.281+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_7994abaa-2724-4e83-a482-eb82413fbec2", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    GROUNDEDNESS v2.0 — EVIDENCE AUDIT\n    You are an evidence-groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank assistant.\n\n    Permitted Evidence (Task-Level Approved Evidence, Pending Service Request Count, and Unavailable Service Requests — the only factual sources for answers and answer UI):\n    {\"approved_by_task\": [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"I lost my credit card and need to know the procedure for reporting it.\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"I want to change my registered address.\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_24568045\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my personal details—address, phone number, or email—within the Horizon ecosystem?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your personal information can now be done directly through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_002}}. Tap the Profile icon located at the upper‑right corner.\\n{{faq_24568045_003}}. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\\n{{faq_24568045_004}}. Choose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email).\\n{{faq_24568045_005}}. For phone number or email changes, enter the one‑time password (OTP) sent to you.\\n{{faq_24568045_006}}. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied.\\n{{faq_24568045_007}}. After you submit, the change will be processed within {{faq_24568045_008}} hours for phone numbers and email addresses, while address updates take effect instantly.\"}]}], \"pending_service_request_count\": 1, \"unavailable_service_requests\": []}\n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    \n        Original Customer Message (courtesy-context only; never a source for a\n        banking fact, instruction, product capability, policy, or outcome):\n        \"i lost my credit card, what should i do, also i want to change my address too\"\n\n        Optional Internal Response-Element Provenance (not customer-facing):\n        [{\"block_id\": \"element_1\", \"source_task_ids\": [\"task_1\"]}, {\"block_id\": \"element_2\", \"source_task_ids\": [\"task_2\"]}]\n\n        Intent Clarification Inputs (the only source for intent clarification):\n        []\n\n        Terminal Unresolved Task Markers (topic/status only; never evidence):\n        []\n\n        Decline Inputs (the only source for a declined-topic explanation):\n        []\n\n        Customer-Facing Answer:\n        \"If your Horizon card is missing, lost, or stolen, here are the steps you can take to secure your account and request a replacement:\n\nSign in to the Horizon App. On the card overview screen, tap \"View & Manage Card,\" and select \"Freeze Card.\"\n\nOpen the card dashboard, choose \"View & Manage Card,\" and tap \"Freeze Card\" followed by \"Order Replacement.\" Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\n\nYou may also wish to file a police report. Please note that the new card will arrive with a different card number, so be sure to update any recurring payments or subscriptions with your new details. For additional assistance, you can select \"Contact Us\" from the app menu.\n\nTo update your registered address with us:\n\nSign in to the Horizon App and tap the Profile icon located at the upper-right corner. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\n\nChoose the address field you wish to modify. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied, which takes effect instantly after you submit.\"\n\n        Customer-Facing Clarification:\n        \"\"\n\n        Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n        \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"stepper\", \"contextText\": \"If your Horizon card is missing, lost, or stolen, here are the steps you can take to secure your account and request a replacement:\", \"text\": \"\", \"items\": [{\"number\": 1, \"label\": \"Freeze Your Card\", \"detail\": \"Sign in to the Horizon App. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card,\\\" and select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\", \"status\": \"current\"}, {\"number\": 2, \"label\": \"Order a Replacement\", \"detail\": \"Open the card dashboard, choose \\\"View & Manage Card,\\\" and tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\" Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\", \"status\": \"upcoming\"}], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"Reporting a Lost Card\", \"stepDetails\": []