 changing my personal details—address, phone number, or email—within the Horizon ecosystem?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your personal information can now be done directly through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_002}}. Tap the Profile icon located at the upper‑right corner.\\n{{faq_24568045_003}}. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\\n{{faq_24568045_004}}. Choose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email).\\n{{faq_24568045_005}}. For phone number or email changes, enter the one‑time password (OTP) sent to you.\\n{{faq_24568045_006}}. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied.\\n{{faq_24568045_007}}. After you submit, the change will be processed within {{faq_24568045_008}} hours for phone numbers and email addresses, while address updates take effect instantly.\"}]}], \"pending_service_request_count\": 1, \"unavailable_service_requests\": []}\n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    \n        Original Customer Message (courtesy-context only; never a source for a\n        banking fact, instruction, product capability, policy, or outcome):\n        \"i lost my card, i want to replace it and change my address\"\n\n        Optional Internal Response-Element Provenance (not customer-facing):\n        [{\"block_id\": \"element_1\", \"source_task_ids\": [\"task_1\"]}, {\"block_id\": \"element_2\", \"source_task_ids\": [\"task_2\"]}]\n\n        Intent Clarification Inputs (the only source for intent clarification):\n        []\n\n        Terminal Unresolved Task Markers (topic/status only; never evidence):\n        []\n\n        Decline Inputs (the only source for a declined-topic explanation):\n        []\n\n        Customer-Facing Answer:\n        \"If you need to replace your lost card, here are the steps to secure your account and order a new one:\n\nLog into the Horizon App.\n\nOpen the card dashboard and choose \"View & Manage Card.\"\n\nTap \"