{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T08:07:34.140+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_7994abaa-2724-4e83-a482-eb82413fbec2", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): i want to change address, replace card and resubmit my kyc doc\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: i lost my credit card, what should i do, also i want to change my address too\nAI: If your Horizon card is missing, lost, or stolen, here are the steps you can take to secure your account and request a replacement:\n\nSign in to the Horizon App. On the card overview screen, tap \"View & Manage Card,\" and select \"Freeze Card.\"\n\nOpen the card dashboard, choose \"View & Manage Card,\" and tap \"Freeze Card\" followed by \"Order Replacement.\" Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\n\nYou may also wish to file a police report. Please note that the new card will arrive with a different card number, so be sure to update any recurring payments or subscriptions with your new details. For additional assistance, you can select \"Contact Us\" from the app menu.\n\nTo update your registered address with us:\n\nSign in to the Horizon App and tap the Profile icon located at the upper-right corner. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\n\nChoose the address field you wish to modify. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied, which takes effect instantly after you submit.\n\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\nUser: i lost my card, i want to replace it and change my address\nAI: If you need to replace your lost card, here are the steps to secure your account and order a new one:\n\nLog into the Horizon App.\n\nOpen the card dashboard and choose \"View & Manage Card.\"\n\nTap \"Freeze Card\" followed by \"Order Replacement.\" Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\n\nYou may also wish to file a police report. Please note that the new card will arrive with a different card number, so be sure to update any recurring payments or subscriptions with your new details. For additional assistance, you can select \"Contact Us\" from the app menu.\n\nTo update your registered address with us:\n\nSign in to the Horizon App.\n\nTap the Profile icon located at the upper-right corner.\n\nWithin Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\n\nChoose the address field you wish to modify.\n\nProvide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied.\n\nYou can fulfil your request using the form below.\nUser: thank you\nAI: You're very welcome! 😊\nUser: how to open an account?\nAI: I can prepare a summary for a human agent to review your request.\nUser: i want to change address, replace card and resubmit my kyc doc\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"Upload your identification documents through the secure portal link provided in your account notification\", \"policy\": \"KYC documentation must be current and clearly legible to satisfy regulatory identity verification requirements\", \"conceptual\": \"Know Your Customer documentation is the mandatory identity verification process required for all banking accounts\", \"target_commercial_pr