ved limit must be higher than the loan amount you are requesting 💳. During the Instant Loan application process, you may be prompted to provide information regarding your credit preferences. Please note that credit limit approvals are subject to the bank's internal assessment criteria.\"\n\n        Customer-Facing Clarification:\n        \"\"\n\n        Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n        \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"contextText\": \"\", \"text\": \"When submitting an Instant Loan request as a new customer, you may set the credit limit you prefer for your card, keeping in mind that the approved limit must be higher than the loan amount you are requesting 💳. During the Instant Loan application process, you may be prompted to provide information regarding your credit preferences. Please note that credit limit approvals are subject to the bank's internal assessment criteria.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n        \n\n    \nPRECISION REFERENCE CONTRACT:\n- A token matching `{{faq_*}}` is a database-backed exact-value reference,\n  never missing, unknown, incomplete, or a customer-visible template.\n- It may represent an exact amount, rate, limit, date, threshold, or other\n  precise value. Treat it as the underlying approved fact for relevance,\n  sufficiency, generation, compliance, and groundedness.\n- Preserve the token exactly in any draft. The backend deterministically\n  substitutes its authoritative value only after outbound validation.\n- Never reject, weaken, or describe evidence as unavailable merely because the\n  exact value is represented by a `{{faq_*}}` token.\n- Within the stated scope, \"up