{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T14:30:46.532+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_6ba5e262-b2d6-4498-83c8-e53192bdc92c", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    GROUNDEDNESS v2.0 — EVIDENCE AUDIT\n    You are an evidence-groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank assistant.\n\n    Permitted Evidence (Task-Level Approved Evidence, Pending Service Request Count, and Unavailable Service Requests — the only factual sources for answers and answer UI):\n    {\"approved_by_task\": [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"How do I view my bank statements?\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_8fbdd04c\", \"content\": \"Question: Am I able to retrieve historical account statements?\\n\\nAnswer: Yes, the Horizon App provides access to statements for up to seven years.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c4eb321c\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to retrieve my historical account statements?\\n\\nAnswer: - Yes, you can view statements up to seven years old using the Horizon App.\"}]}], \"pending_service_request_count\": 0, \"unavailable_service_requests\": []}\n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    \n        Original Customer Message (courtesy-context only; never a source for a\n        banking fact, instruction, product capability, policy, or outcome):\n        \"How do I view my statements?\"\n\n        Optional Internal Response-Element Provenance (not customer-facing):\n        [{\"block_id\": \"element_1\", \"source_task_ids\": [\"task_1\"]}]\n\n        Intent Clarification Inputs (the only source for intent clarification):\n        []\n\n        Terminal Unresolved Task Markers (topic/status only; never evidence):\n        []\n\n        Decline Inputs (the only source for a declined-topic explanation):\n        []\n\n        Customer-Facing Answer:\n        \"You can view your historical account statements using the Horizon App, which provides access to statements for up to seven years 📱✨.\"\n\n        Customer-Facing Clarification:\n        \"\"\n\n        Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n        \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"contextText\": \"\", \"text\": \"You can view your historical account statements using the Horizon App, which provides access to statements for up to seven years 📱✨.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n        \n\n    \nPRECISION REFERENCE CONTRACT:\n- A token matching `{{faq_*}}` is a database-backed exact-value reference,\n  never missing, unknown, incomplete, or a customer-visible template.\n- It may represent an exact amount, rate, limit, date, threshold, or other\n  precise value. Treat it as the underlying approved fact for relevance,\n  sufficiency, generation, compliance, and groundedness.\n- Preserve the token exactly in any draft. The backend deterministically\n  substitutes its authoritative value only after outbound validation.\n- Never reject, weaken, or describe evidence as unavailable merely because the\n  exact value is represented by a `{{faq_*}}` token.\n- Within the stated scope, \"up to {{faq_*}}\" expresses an exact maximum. It\n  supports the bounded conclusion that the stated coverage or benefit does not\n  exceed that value. It does not, by itself, support claims about applications,\n  approvals, denials, exceptions, or who controls the limit.\n\n\n    TASK: Assess EVIDENCE GROUNDEDNESS ONLY. Do not assess conduct, tone,\n    regulatory compliance, or completeness — a separate auditor handles those.\n    Every factual claim, instruction, figure, or suggestion in the Customer-Facing\n    Content must be directly supported by the Permitted Evidence above; nothing