{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T16:12:38.003+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_213bc65b-44ef-4688-afc4-55732ac15111", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): I want to view my statements\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: I want to view my statements\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to the account dashboard and select the statements tab to download your monthly transaction history\", \"policy\": \"Bank statements are generated monthly and are available for download for up to seven years of history\", \"conceptual\": \"A bank statement is a formal record of all transactions and balances associated with your deposit account\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\"], \"customer_component\": \"The customer wants to view their bank statements.\", \"direct_query\": \"The customer wants to view their bank statements.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to the account dashboard and select the statements tab to download your monthly transaction history\", \"policy\": \"Bank statements are generated monthly and are available for download for up to seven years of history\", \"conceptual\": \"A bank statement is a formal record of all transactions and balances associated with your deposit account\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_f87ebecc\", \"content\": \"Question: Could you provide the necessary codes for identifying Horizon Bank, including the bank code and BIC code?\\n\\nAnswer: For your reference, Horizon Bank Singapore Limited can be identified by the following codes: \\n      * Bank Name: Horizon Bank Singapore Limited\\n      * Bank Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_001}}\\n      * BIC Code: HRZNSGSG\\n      * Branch Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_002}}\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_8fbdd04c\", \"content\": \"Question: Am I able to retrieve historical account statements?\\n\\nAnswer: Yes, the Horizon App provides access to statements for up to seven years.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_24638b08\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I locate my Horizon Bank account number?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App and sign in.\\n- Choose the “Savings” section.\\n- Your account number is displayed on the primary account card, following the label “Main –”.\\n- To copy it, tap the primary card and select the copy icon within the “Horizon savings account number” panel.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e200634\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the details of Horizon Bank's Signature deposit plan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The Signature plan lets you earn up to {{faq_6e200634_001}} per annum on the first {{faq_6e200634_002}} million of your deposit balance. The rate is built from several components:\\n  * A base interest of {{faq_6e200634_003}} p.a. that applies automatically;\\n  * A spend‑bonus of {{faq_6e200634_004}} p.a. for NTUC Union members (or {{faq_6e200634_005}} p.a. for non‑members) when you complete five qualifying {{faq_6e200634_006}} card transactions within the month;\\n  * A balance‑bonus of {{faq_6e200634_007}} p.a. once your average daily balance for the month reaches {{faq_6e200634_008}};\\n  * A salary‑bonus of {{faq_6e200634_009}} p.a. if you receive a minimum salary credit of {{faq_6e200634_010}} in a single GIRO transaction during the month.\\n- Any portion of the balance that exceeds {{faq_6e200634_011}} million earns interest at the base rate of {{faq_6e200634_012}} p.a.\\n- Interest is credited on the last day of each month.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          the customer's wording or explicitly resolve every possible\n          interpretation of the customer's question.\n        - PARTIAL-EVIDENCE DECISION ORDER: First identify whether any supplied\n          parent contains a factual proposition directly relevant to a\n          meaningful aspect of the customer's resolved request. If one does,\n          do not return INSUFFICIENT merely because the parent cannot determine\n          the customer's requested outcome, permission, eligibility,\n          exception, legality, preferred action, or other broader conclusion.\n          Retain that parent as PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT when its supported fact\n          can be truthfully