{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T17:02:17.095+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_f94eea34-9fd5-4774-8324-bb3efb37b7b2", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): i want to change my address and view my statements, and what's the elibility for applying a loan?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: i want to change my address and view my statements, and what's the elibility for applying a loan?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Update residential address details through the profile settings menu in the mobile application or online banking portal.\", \"policy\": \"Proof of address documentation is required for all permanent residential address changes to ensure account security compliance.\", \"conceptual\": \"Profile updates allow customers to maintain accurate contact information for official bank correspondence and security notifications.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Horizon_APP\", \"target_intent\": [\"Profile Updates\"], \"customer_component\": \"I want to change my address.\", \"direct_query\": \"I want to change my address.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Update residential address details through the profile settings menu in the mobile application or online banking portal.\", \"policy\": \"Proof of address documentation is required for all permanent residential address changes to ensure account security compliance.\", \"conceptual\": \"Profile updates allow customers to maintain accurate contact information for official bank correspondence and security notifications.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e2d941d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my home address when applying for a Horizon Bank account?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Singapore citizens and Permanent Residents (effective {{faq_6e2d941d_001}} Oct {{faq_6e2d941d_002}})**: All address modifications must be submitted through Singpass. Steps:\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_003}}. Sign in to Singpass and choose your language.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_004}}. Verify that the details entered in your Horizon Bank application are accurate before proceeding.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_005}}. Submit the request; ICA will mail a {{faq_6e2d941d_006}}‑digit PIN to your new residence.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_007}}. For local addresses, the PIN letter typically arrives within one week.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_008}}. Use the PIN to continue your Horizon Bank onboarding via the ICA e‑Service portal. (Further guidance available via the provided link.)\\n- **Non‑Singapore residents**:\\n  - *Option {{faq_6e2d941d_009}}*: Access the myTax Portal with your Singpass or Singpass Foreign Account (SFA), select “Update Contact Details,” and amend your residential or mailing address. The update is reflected within three business days. (More information at the linked page.)\\n  - *Option {{faq_6e2d941d_010}}*: Go to the Ministry of Manpower (MoM) website and follow these actions:\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_011}}. Click “Log in for EP Online with Singpass” under the pass‑holder section.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_012}}. Log in using your Singpass credentials.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_013}}. Choose “Change Particulars – Personal Contact Details and Residential Address of Pass Holder.”\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_014}}. Input your Main Pass ID and search.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_015}}. Edit the residential postal address and save the changes.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Access monthly electronic statements by navigating to the account summary section and selecting the statements download option.\", \"policy\": \"Electronic statements are available for viewing and downloading for up to seven years of account history.\", \"conceptual\": \"Bank statements provide a comprehensive record of all transactions, interest earned, and fees charged during a billing cycle.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\"], \"customer_component\": \"I want to view my bank statements.\", \"direct_query\": \"I want to view my bank statements.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Access monthly electronic statements by navigating to the account summary section and selecting the statements download option.\", \"policy\": \"Electronic statements are available for viewing and downloading for up to seven years of account history.\", \"conceptual\": \"Bank statements provide a comprehensive record of all transactions, interest earned, and fees charged during a billing cycle.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_c4eb321c\", \"content\": \"Question: Is it possible to retrieve my historical account statements?\\n\\nAnswer: - Yes, you can view statements up to seven years old using the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_8fbdd04c\", \"content\": \"Question: Am I able to retrieve historical account statements?\\n\\nAnswer: Yes, the Horizon App provides access to statements for up to seven years.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_24638b08\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I locate my Horizon Bank account number?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App and sign in.\\n- Choose the “Savings” section.\\n- Your account number is displayed on the primary account card, following the label “Main –”.\\n- To copy it, tap the primary card and select the copy icon within the “Horizon savings account number” panel.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_95665e33\", \"content\": \"Question: How do I locate my Horizon Bank account number within the app?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App and sign in.\\n- Navigate to the **Savings** tab.\\n- Your account number appears on the primary account card under the \\\"Main\\\" heading.\\n- To copy it, tap the card and select the copy icon shown in the \\\"Horizon savings account number\\\" panel.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"Submit income verification documents and employment history records to initiate the personal loan application and eligibility review process.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age requirements and maintain a stable monthly income threshold to qualify for loan approval.\", \"conceptual\": \"Eligibility criteria define the financial and personal benchmarks required for the bank to approve a personal loan request.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Eligibility\", \"Application\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the eligibility criteria for applying for a loan?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the eligibility criteria for applying for a loan?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_3\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Submit income verification documents and employment history records to initiate the personal loan application and eligibility review process.\", \"policy\": \"Applicants must meet minimum age requirements and maintain a stable monthly income threshold to qualify for loan approval.\", \"conceptual\": \"Eligibility criteria define the financial and personal benchmarks required for the bank to approve a personal loan request.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical timeframe for my loan to be approved?\\n\\nAnswer: - The vast majority of loans are approved and the amount is deposited into your Horizon savings account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"content\": \"Question: If my Instant Loan request is declined, can I still submit applications for other Horizon Bank products such as a credit card or a savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Absolutely. A declined loan does not prevent you from applying for other Horizon Bank offerings. You simply need to start a new application tailored to the specific product you wish to obtain.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that