   Output JSON only:\n    {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false, \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\"}\n    "}
{"timestamp": "2026-08-24T17:27:24.312+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_f94eea34-9fd5-4774-8324-bb3efb37b7b2", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    GROUNDEDNESS v2.0 — EVIDENCE AUDIT\n    You are an evidence-groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank assistant.\n\n    Permitted Evidence (Task-Level Approved Evidence, Available Shortcuts, and Unavailable Service Requests — the only factual sources for answers and answer UI):\n    {\"approved_by_task\": [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"How do I change my Horizon app PIN?\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_406bf55a\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I update the PIN for my Horizon security key?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon app and sign in.\\n- Go to the \\\"Profile\\\" menu and select \\\"Security\\\".\\n- Tap \\\"Change Horizon Key PIN\\\".\\n- Follow the on‑screen directions to set a new PIN.\\n- Note that the new PIN will only become usable after a {{faq_406bf55a_001}}‑hour waiting period.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_46116179\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps should I take if I have forgotten the PIN for my Horizon Key?\\n\\nAnswer: - You will need to reset your Horizon Key PIN.\\n{{faq_46116179_001}}. Open the Horizon App and sign in.\\n{{faq_46116179_002}}. Navigate to the \\\"Profile\\\" section, then scroll down to \\\"Security\\\".\\n{{faq_46116179_003}}. Select the option \\\"Change Horizon Key\\\".\\n{{faq_46116179_004}}. Follow the on‑screen prompts to set a new PIN.\\nPlease note that after resetting, a {{faq_46116179_005}}‑hour cooling period applies before the Horizon Key can be used again.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_e50ada50\", \"content\": \"Question: I entered the wrong PIN several times and now my Horizon Key is locked. How can I unlock it?\\n\\nAnswer: - After you open the Horizon App, you will be prompted to re‑configure your Horizon Key. Follow these steps to reset your PIN:\\n{{faq_e50ada50_0