on, then pick **Coupons** or **Stamp cards** to see current merchant coupons.\\n- Before signing in: Tap the coupon icon displayed on the pre‑login screen to browse available coupons.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_31afb42a\", \"content\": \"Question: If I currently have a Link account connected to my existing rewards card, will applying for a Horizon Bank Link card cause any disruptions to my rewards balance or transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: Upon successful application for your Horizon card, your Link account will seamlessly integrate with your new Horizon Link card, allowing you to view your Linkpoints balance and transaction history within the Horizon App. For detailed information on Link rewards, NTUC benefits, or Visa card perks, please visit the Link Rewards website. Alternatively, you can contact the Customer Care Team through the webform available at https://support.link.sg/hc/en-us/requests/new for personalized assistance.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_da866599\", \"content\": \"Question: As a current member of the rewards program, will my existing membership automatically connect to my Horizon Bank card?\\n\\nAnswer: Indeed, upon approval of your application, your existing rewards membership will be seamlessly integrated with your new Horizon card. This integration enables you to accumulate rewards points through your debit or credit card transactions and conveniently monitor your points balance and transaction history within the Horizon App.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments.