{"timestamp": "2026-08-25T04:29:03.393+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_96d7d668-9f1a-49e9-98e1-f608cb8531de", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    GROUNDEDNESS v2.0 — EVIDENCE AUDIT\n    You are an evidence-groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank assistant.\n\n    Permitted Evidence (Last Session Transcript and Pending Service Requests):\n    {\"last_session_transcript\": [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Ben! How can I help with your banking today?\\n\\nYou can fulfil these requests using the forms below.\\n\\nIt looks like you have pending requests to change your address and resubmit a KYC document; would you still like to complete them?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Go ahead, I'm listening 😊\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"I can prepare a summary for a human agent to review your request.\"}], \"pending_service_requests\": [{\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"topic\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\"}, {\"label\": \"Resubmit KYC Document\", \"topic\": \"Resubmit an identity document for an existing customer's KYC record.\"}]}\n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    Would you like to continue discussing your address and loyalty tier from our last chat? It also looks like you have pending requests to change your address and resubmit a KYC document; would you still like to complete them?\n\n    \nPRECISION REFERENCE CONTRACT:\n- A token matching `{{faq_*}}` is a database-backed exact-value reference,\n  never missing, unknown, incomplete, or a customer-visible template.\n- It may represent an exact amount, rate, limit, date, threshold, or other\n  precise value. Treat it as the underlying approved fact for relevance,\n  sufficiency, generation, compliance, and groundedness.\n- Preserve the token exactly in any draft. The backend