{"timestamp": "2026-08-25T04:29:37.099+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_96d7d668-9f1a-49e9-98e1-f608cb8531de", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Ben! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil these requests using the forms below.\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to profile settings to view or update the current residential address details on file\", \"policy\": \"Registered address must be a valid residential location supported by official government issued identification documents\", \"conceptual\": \"The registered address is the primary contact location used for all official bank correspondence and statements\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Horizon_APP\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Features And Limits\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the customer's registered address on file?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the customer's registered address on file?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to profile settings to view or update the current residential address details on file\", \"policy\": \"Registered address must be a valid residential location supported by official government issued identification documents\", \"conceptual\": \"The registered address is the primary contact location used for all official bank correspondence and statements\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided evidence describes the procedure for changing an address, but does not contain information on how to view the current address on file.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e2d941d\", \"fact\": \"Address modifications for Singapore residents must be submitted through Singpass.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_817eef20\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps do I need to follow to find my Horizon referral code?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, navigate to your profile section, and tap on \\\"Invite Friends\\\" to display your referral code.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_24568045\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my personal details—address, phone number, or email—within the Horizon ecosystem?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your personal information can now be done directly through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_002}}. Tap the Profile icon located at the upper‑right corner.\\n{{faq_24568045_003}}. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\\n{{faq_24568045_004}}. Choose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email).\\n{{faq_24568045_005}}. For phone number or email changes, enter the one‑time password (OTP) sent to you.\\n{{faq_24568045_006}}. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied.\\n{{faq_24568045_007}}. After you submit, the change will be processed within {{faq_24568045_008}} hours for phone numbers and email addresses, while address updates take effect instantly.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_717608ab\", \"content\": \"Question: In which section of the Horizon App should I enter my referral code?\\n\\nAnswer: - Launch the Horizon App, pick your preferred language, and tap “Get started” to begin the onboarding process.\\n- When prompted, type in your referral code.\\n- After completing registration, the referral bonus will be credited to your account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_f87ebecc\", \"content\": \"Question: Could you provide the necessary codes for identifying Horizon Bank, including the bank code and BIC code?\\n\\nAnswer: For your reference, Horizon Bank Singapore Limited can be identified by the following codes: \\n      * Bank Name: Horizon Bank Singapore Limited\\n      * Bank Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_001}}\\n      * BIC Code: HRZNSGSG\\n      * Branch Code: {{faq_f87ebecc_002}}\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Check current loyalty status by logging into the rewards dashboard within the mobile banking application\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tier status is determined by monthly transaction volume and total assets held with the bank\", \"conceptual\": \"Loyalty tiers provide tiered access to exclusive rewards, preferential interest rates, and dedicated customer service support\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Rewards_Program\", \"target_intent\": [\"Authentication And Security\", \"Features And Limits\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the customer's current loyalty tier?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the customer's current loyalty tier?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\"