{"timestamp": "2026-08-25T04:29:42.463+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_96d7d668-9f1a-49e9-98e1-f608cb8531de", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Ben! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil these requests using the forms below.\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to profile settings to view or update the current residential address details on file\", \"policy\": \"Registered address must be a valid residential location supported by official government issued identification documents\", \"conceptual\": \"The registered address is the primary contact location used for all official bank correspondence and statements\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Horizon_APP\", \"Credit_Card\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Features And Limits\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Application\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the customer's registered address on file?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the customer's registered address on file?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to profile settings to view or update the current residential address details on file\", \"policy\": \"Registered address must be a valid residential location supported by official government issued identification documents\", \"conceptual\": \"The registered address is the primary contact location used for all official bank correspondence and statements\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [\"faq_24568045\"], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided evidence describes the procedure for changing an address, but does not contain information on how to view the current address on file.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e2d941d\", \"fact\": \"Address modifications for Singapore residents must be submitted through Singpass.\"}]}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_24568045\"], \"reason\": \"The provided evidence explains how to navigate to the personal details section in the Horizon App to view or modify the address, which is materially relevant to the customer's request to know their address on file.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6dae126c\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the process for updating the personal identification number associated with my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: To update your Horizon card PIN, follow these straightforward steps: \\n      * Access your Horizon App account\\n      * Navigate to the 'Card Details' section\\n      * Choose the 'Modify PIN' option and create a new {{faq_6dae126c_001}}-digit PIN for enhanced security and convenience\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_12b5523e\", \"content\": \"Question: I submitted an online application for a Horizon credit card. Where can I view the complete details of my Horizon account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Install the Horizon App on your device and sign in using MyInfo. Ensure your MyInfo profile is fully set up for a seamless first login.\\n- After logging in, the Horizon App provides full control over your credit card, allowing you to:\\n  - Review card information such as number, expiration date, and CVV\\n  - Activate the newly issued physical card\\n  - Lock or unlock the card as needed\\n  - Add the card to Apple Wallet\\n  - Request a change to your credit limit\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c472274b\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank define its regulated customer base in terms of residency and income?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, regulated customers are defined as individuals who are either citizens or permanent residents of Singapore, with an annual income of less than {{faq_c472274b_001}}.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_91823b7a\", \"content\": \"Question: My online application has been approved—where can I find my Horizon card information such as the number, expiration date, and CVV?\\n\\nAnswer: - After your Horizon card is approved, download the Horizon App and sign in with your MyInfo credentials. Within the app you can view the full {{faq_91823b7a_001}}‑digit card number, the expiry date, and the CVV. You also have the option to add the digital card to Apple Wallet for convenient and secure payments.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_24568045\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my personal details—address, phone number, or email—within the Horizon ecosystem?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your personal information can now be done directly through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_002}}. Tap the Profile icon located at the upper‑right corner.\\n{{faq_24568045_003}}. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\\n{{faq_24568045_004}}. Choose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email).\\n{{faq_24568045_005}}. For phone number or email changes, enter the one‑time password (OTP) sent to you.\\n{{faq_24568045_006}}. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied.\\n{{faq_24568045_007}}. After you submit, the change will be processed within {{faq_24568045_008}} hours for phone numbers and email addresses, while address updates take effect instantly.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Check current loyalty status by logging into the rewards dashboard within the mobile banking application\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tier status is determined by monthly transaction volume and total assets held with the bank\", \"conceptual\": \"Loyalty tiers provide tiered access to exclusive rewards, preferential interest rates, and dedicated customer service support\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Rewards_Program\", \"ALL\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Authentication And Security\", \"Features And Limits\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Account Management\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the customer's current loyalty tier?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the customer's current loyalty tier?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Check current loyalty status by logging into the rewards dashboard within the mobile banking application\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tier status is determined by monthly transaction volume and total assets held with the bank\", \"conceptual\": \"Loyalty tiers provide tiered access to exclusive rewards, preferential interest rates, and dedicated customer service support\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided evidence discusses loyalty program integration, bonus point eligibility, and digital voucher management, but does not provide information on how to determine or view the customer's current loyalty tier.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_5a7395a4\", \"fact\": \"Eligibility for quarterly bonus Linkpoints depends on meeting specific monthly spend requirements.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_13c2c54b\", \"fact\": \"Exclusive, award-based coupons are issued to customers who meet specific eligibility criteria.\"}]}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided evidence describes the bank's general product offerings and mentions the existence of a rewards program, but does not contain information on how to view or determine the customer's specific loyalty tier status.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_38edd534\", \"content\": \"Question: What inspired the choice of name for Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: The naming of Horizon Bank was the result of rigorous market research and feedback from our valued customers in Singapore. Our findings indicated that the name Horizon embodies the principles that our clients expect from their banking institution, aligning with the core values that have guided our establishment and the reputation of our stakeholders in Singapore. Furthermore, the inclusive nature of our brand identity symbolizes our commitment to serving the diverse community of Singapore, fostering a sense of unity and shared purpose.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ded247c0\", \"content\": \"Question: What sets Horizon Bank apart from traditional banking institutions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we've revolutionized the banking experience by leveraging cutting-edge technology to create a seamless, mobile-first platform. By streamlining processes and eliminating the need for physical branches, we're able to provide our customers with a {{faq_ded247c0_001}}/{{faq_ded247c0_002}} banking service that's both convenient and efficient. A prime illustration of this is our expedited sign-up process, which can be completed in mere minutes for Singapore residents utilizing Singpass, highlighting our commitment to simplicity and speed.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7fc44444\", \"content\": \"Question: How does Horizon Bank collaborate with regulatory bodies to combat cyber threats and protect customers from fraudulent activities?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we are committed to safeguarding our customers' interests through a collaborative approach with the Monetary Authority of Singapore and other relevant authorities. The Shared Responsibility Framework is a pivotal initiative that underscores the importance of joint efforts between banks, regulatory bodies, and customers in preventing and mitigating the impact of scams. This framework specifically addresses vulnerabilities that scammers may exploit, including impersonation of legitimate entities, such as government agencies or financial institutions like Horizon Bank, where fraudsters deceive customers into divulging sensitive information. Additionally, it tackles the risks associated with malicious links sent via digital platforms, which can lead to the compromise of account credentials. By promoting a culture of shared responsibility, we aim to empower our customers with the knowledge and best practices necessary to secure their financial information and transactions, thereby fostering a safer digital banking environment for all.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_a171e351\", \"content\": \"Question: Can you tell me about the background of Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank, operating under the Horizon brand, is a pioneering digital banking institution, born out of an innovative collaboration between a prominent international banking group and a local social enterprise. This distinctive alliance leverages the strengths of both partners, combining over two centuries of collective experience serving the Singapore market.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          the customer's wording or explicitly resolve every possible\n          interpretation of the customer's question.\n        - PARTIAL-EVIDENCE DECISION ORDER: First identify whether any supplied\n          parent contains a factual proposition directly relevant to a\n          meaningful aspect of the customer's resolved request. If one does,\n          do not return INSUFFICIENT merely because the parent cannot determine\n          the customer's requested outcome, permission, eligibility,\n          exception, legality, preferred action, or other broader conclusion.\n          Retain that parent as PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT when its supported fact\n          can be truthfully presented as useful, bounded Horizon guidance\n          while another material aspect remains unresolved. Continue retrieval\n          for the unresolved aspect.\n        - Return INSUFFICIENT only when no supplied parent contains any\n          factual proposition that can be truthfully and materially presented\n          in relation to the resolved request. A parent is not material merely\n          because it concerns the same product: its supported fact must\n          directly concern the same topic, condition, process, boundary, or\n          factual premise in the customer's request.\n        - SUFFICIENT: the selected parents contain enough grounded information\n          for a useful response to the `customer_component`, even when that\n          response is an explicit policy boundary, limit, condition,\n          restriction, or other related factual information rather than a\n          literal yes/no answer. The response generator will state only what\n          the evidence supports and must not invent a broader conclusion.\n        \nPRECISION REFERENCE CONTRACT:\n- A token matching `{{faq_*}}` is a database-backed exact-value reference,\n  never missing, unknown, incomplete, or a customer-visible template.\n- It may represent an exact amount, rate, limit, date, threshold, or other\n  precise value. Treat it as the underlying approved fact for relevance,\n  sufficiency, generation, compliance, and groundedness.\n- Preserve the token exactly in any draft. The backend deterministically\n  substitutes its authoritative value only after outbound validation.\n- Never reject, weaken, or describe evidence as unavailable merely because the\n  exact value is represented by a `{{faq_*}}` token.\n- Within the stated scope, \"up to {{faq_*}}\" expresses an exact maximum. It\n  supports the bounded conclusion that the stated coverage or benefit does not\n  exceed that value. It does not, by itself, support claims about applications,\n  approvals, denials, exceptions, or who controls the limit.\n\n        - PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT: selected parents provide grounded, material\n          information for one meaningful part of the `customer_component`,\n          while another material part has no useful related evidence. Select\n          only the supporting parent IDs; the backend will retain them