, \"Interest And Rates\", \"Loan And Credit Management\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the customer's registered address on file?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the customer's registered address on file?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to profile settings to view or update the current residential address details on file\", \"policy\": \"Registered address must be a valid residential location supported by official government issued identification documents\", \"conceptual\": \"The registered address is the primary contact location used for all official bank correspondence and statements\"}, {\"group_id\": \"retry_4\", \"procedural\": \"Verify current residential records by accessing the personal information section within the secure mobile banking portal\", \"policy\": \"Bank records require periodic validation of residential status to ensure compliance with regulatory communication and mailing standards\", \"conceptual\": \"The residential address serves as the official record for all legal notices and physical document delivery services\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [\"faq_24568045\"], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided evidence describes the procedure for changing an address, but does not contain information on how to view the current address on file.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e2d941d\", \"fact\": \"Address modifications for Singapore residents must be submitted through Singpass.\"}]}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_24568045\"], \"reason\": \"The provided evidence explains how to navigate to the personal details section in the Horizon App to view or modify the address, which is materially relevant to the customer's request to know their address on file.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}, {\"attempt\": 3, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_24568045\"], \"reason\": \"The provided evidence explains how to navigate to the personal details section in the Horizon App to view or modify the address, which is materially relevant to the customer's request to know their address on file.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7b4f60c3\", \"content\": \"Question: What verification process does Horizon Bank use to confirm the accuracy of my PayNow name after an update?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we work in conjunction with the PayNow scheme operator to ensure that your PayNow name reflects your registered account name on record. This collaborative effort guarantees that rigorous checks are in place to verify the correctness of your updated PayNow name, providing you with assurance of its accuracy.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_11305460\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I change personal information such as my NRIC/FIN, nationality, name, or the name embossed on my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: - To modify details like NRIC/FIN, nationality, legal name, or the card‑embossing name, reach out to Horizon Customer Care via the Horizon app’s call or chat function. Expect a response within roughly three business days.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_02489175\", \"content\": \"Question: What information will be displayed when I initiate a payment to a recipient through Horizon Bank's digital banking services?\\n\\nAnswer: When sending funds to an individual recipient, you will notice that only a portion of their name is visible after entering their PayNow proxy. However, for corporate recipients, the full registered company name will be displayed as usual. This applies to all PayNow transactions, including those made using the Scan to Pay feature within the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_b68f02e7\", \"content\": \"Question: How will I be informed about updates to my account status with Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: Rest assured, you will be kept in the loop about any changes to your status through notifications sent via the Horizon App and email updates from Horizon Bank.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_24568045\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my personal details—address, phone number, or email—within the Horizon ecosystem?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your personal information can now be done directly through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_002}}. Tap the Profile icon located at the upper‑right corner.\\n{{faq_24568045_003}}. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\\n{{faq_24568045_004}}. Choose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email).\\n{{faq_24568045_005}}. For phone number or email changes, enter the one‑time password (OTP) sent to you.\\n{{faq_24568045_006}}. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied.\\n{{faq_24568045_007}}. After you submit, the change will be processed within {{faq_24568045_008}} hours for phone numbers and email addresses, while address updates take effect instantly.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Check current loyalty status by logging into the rewards dashboard within the mobile banking application\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tier status is determined by monthly transaction volume and total assets held with the bank\", \"conceptual\": \"Loyalty tiers provide tiered access to exclusive rewards, preferential interest rates, and dedicated customer service support\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Rewards_Program\", \"ALL\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Authentication And Security\", \"Features And Limits\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Account Management\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the customer's current loyalty tier?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the customer's current loyalty t