ask_ids\": [\"task_1\"], \"unresolved_topics\": []}\n    Approved evidence by retrieval task: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"resolved_request\": \"What is the customer's registered address on file?\", \"approved_parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_24568045\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my personal details—address, phone number, or email—within the Horizon ecosystem?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your personal information can now be done directly through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_002}}. Tap the Profile icon located at the upper‑right corner.\\n{{faq_24568045_003}}. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\\n{{faq_24568045_004}}. Choose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email).\\n{{faq_24568045_005}}. For phone number or email changes, enter the one‑time password (OTP) sent to you.\\n{{faq_24568045_006}}. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied.\\n{{faq_24568045_007}}. After you submit, the change will be processed within {{faq_24568045_008}} hours for phone numbers and email addresses, while address updates take effect instantly.\"}]}]\n    Intent clarification inputs: []\n    Terminal unresolved task markers (topic/status only; never evidence): [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"type\": \"TERMINAL_RETRIEVAL_FEEDBACK\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"What is the customer's registered address on file?\", \"resolution_status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\"}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"type\": \"TERMINAL_RETRIEVAL_FEEDBACK\", \"resolved_subquery\": \"What is the customer's current loyalty tier?\", \"resolution_status\": \"CLARIFICATION_REQUIRED\"}]\n    Decline inputs: []\n    Available shortcuts this turn (each is either a \"form\" -- a guided\n    service request the customer could complete instead of the manual FAQ\n    steps -- or \"navigation\" -- a direct in-app link to the relevant screen.\n    Each button is attached