de at FairPrice, FairPrice Finest, FairPrice Xtra, FairPrice Online, Warehouse Club, Unity, and Cheers stores, as well as participating Kopitiam stalls, excluding FairPrice Xpress and Cheers outlets within Esso stations. You will receive the quarterly bonus Linkpoints on your FairPrice Group spend once the transactions are posted in the month.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_0a4686e9\", \"content\": \"Question: If I change a voucher’s status to 'Redeemed' in the Horizon app, what will occur?\\n\\nAnswer: • After you set a coupon or voucher to 'Redeemed', its status is updated and it no longer appears on the active Rewards dashboard or in the My Coupons section.\\n• The item remains accessible in the 'Redeemed/Expired' tab for reference.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_da866599\", \"content\": \"Question: As a current member of the rewards program, will my existing membership automatically connect to my Horizon Bank card?\\n\\nAnswer: Indeed, upon approval of your application, your existing rewards membership will be seamlessly integrated with your new Horizon card. This integration enables you to accumulate rewards points through your debit or credit card transactions and conveniently monitor your points balance and transaction history within the Horizon App.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PA