{"timestamp": "2026-08-25T05:30:59.438+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_060a57f6-dabe-4ef7-85f2-208c9bfadb3d", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on?\nAI: Your residential address on file is {{data-3bdafef9}}, and your current loyalty tier is Gold. 🏦✨\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on?\nAI: Your residential address on file is {{data-da1d30a8}}, and your current loyalty tier is Gold. 🏦✨\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to profile settings to view or update your registered residential address details\", \"policy\": \"Residential address records must be kept current to ensure receipt of important bank correspondence\", \"conceptual\": \"The residential address on file is the primary location associated with your banking profile\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Horizon_APP\", \"target_intent\": [\"Profile Updates\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is my residential address on file?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is my residential address on file?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to profile settings to view or update your registered residential address details\", \"policy\": \"Residential address records must be kept current to ensure receipt of important bank correspondence\", \"conceptual\": \"The residential address on file is the primary location associated with your banking profile\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e2d941d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my home address when applying for a Horizon Bank account?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Singapore citizens and Permanent Residents (effective {{faq_6e2d941d_001}} Oct {{faq_6e2d941d_002}})**: All address modifications must be submitted through Singpass. Steps:\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_003}}. Sign in to Singpass and choose your language.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_004}}. Verify that the details entered in your Horizon Bank application are accurate before proceeding.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_005}}. Submit the request; ICA will mail a {{faq_6e2d941d_006}}‑digit PIN to your new residence.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_007}}. For local addresses, the PIN letter typically arrives within one week.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_008}}. Use the PIN to continue your Horizon Bank onboarding via the ICA e‑Service portal. (Further guidance available via the provided link.)\\n- **Non‑Singapore residents**:\\n  - *Option {{faq_6e2d941d_009}}*: Access the myTax Portal with your Singpass or Singpass Foreign Account (SFA), select “Update Contact Details,” and amend your residential or mailing address. The update is reflected within three business days. (More information at the linked page.)\\n  - *Option {{faq_6e2d941d_010}}*: Go to the Ministry of Manpower (MoM) website and follow these actions:\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_011}}. Click “Log in for EP Online with Singpass” under the pass‑holder section.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_012}}. Log in using your Singpass credentials.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_013}}. Choose “Change Particulars – Personal Contact Details and Residential Address of Pass Holder.”\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_014}}. Input your Main Pass ID and search.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_015}}. Edit the residential postal address and save the changes.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Check your current loyalty status by accessing the rewards dashboard within your mobile banking app\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tier status is determined by your total banking relationship and qualifying monthly activity\", \"conceptual\": \"Loyalty tiers provide tiered access to exclusive rewards and preferential banking benefits for customers\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Rewards_Program\", \"target_intent\": [\"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is my current loyalty tier?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is my current loyalty tier?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Check your current loyalty status by accessing the rewards dashboard within your mobile banking app\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tier status is determined by your total banking relationship and qualifying monthly activity\", \"conceptual\": \"Loyalty tiers provide tiered access to exclusive rewards and preferential banking benefits for customers\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_8065dd4a\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps can I take to integrate my loyalty program membership with the Horizon Bank partner merchant application?\\n\\nAnswer: To establish a connection between your membership and the partner app, kindly refer to the comprehensive guide available at the Horizon Bank support portal, which outlines the straightforward process for linking your accounts and unlocking exclusive rewards.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5a7395a4\", \"content\": \"Question: How do I qualify for and receive the quarterly bonus Linkpoints on my FairPrice Group purchases made with my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: To be eligible for the quarterly bonus Linkpoints on your FairPrice Group spend, you must first meet the minimum monthly spend requirement for three consecutive months, starting from the month your Horizon card is approved. The required spend amounts are {{faq_5a7395a4_001}} for NTUC Link Credit cardholders, {{faq_5a7395a4_002}} for Horizon Link Credit cardholders, or {{faq_5a7395a4_003}} for NTUC Link Debit and Horizon Link Debit cardholders, based on the posting date of your transactions. Once you've met this condition, you'll receive the quarterly bonus Linkpoints on all your posted FairPrice Group spend. Additionally, if you meet the higher minimum monthly spend of {{faq_5a7395a4_004}} for NTUC Link Credit and Horizon Link Credit cardholders, or {{faq_5a7395a4_005}} for NTUC Link Debit and Horizon Link Debit cardholders, you'll be eligible for an extra quarterly bonus. The FairPrice Group spend includes purchases made at FairPrice, FairPrice Finest, FairPrice Xtra, FairPrice Online, Warehouse Club, Unity, and Cheers stores, as well as participating Kopitiam stalls, excluding FairPrice Xpress and Cheers outlets within Esso stations. You will receive the quarterly bonus Linkpoints on your FairPrice Group spend once the transactions are posted in the month.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_da866599\", \"content\": \"Question: As a current member of the rewards program, will my existing membership automatically connect to my Horizon Bank card?\\n\\nAnswer: Indeed, upon approval of your application, your existing rewards membership will be seamlessly integrated with your new Horizon card. This integration enables you to accumulate rewards points through your debit or credit card transactions and conveniently monitor your points balance and transaction history within the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_560b6fac\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm an existing Horizon Bank rewards member, but my new Horizon card is linked to a freshly created account. How can I ensure my previously accumulated rewards are preserved?\\n\\nAnswer: To safeguard your existing rewards balance, kindly contact the Horizon Bank Customer Support Team through their dedicated web portal to seek assistance and guidance on merging your accounts.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"View current interest rates for your specific savings account type through the account details menu\", \"policy\": \"Interest rates are subject to change based on prevailing market conditions and account balance tiers\", \"conceptual\": \"The interest rate represents the annual percentage yield earned on funds held in your savings account\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Interest And Rates\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the interest rate for my savings account?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the interest rate for my savings account?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_3\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"View current interest rates for your specific savings account type through the account details menu\", \"policy\": \"Interest rates are subject to change based on prevailing market conditions and account balance tiers\", \"conceptual\": \"The interest rate represents the annual percentage yield earned on funds held in your savings account\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_0b62be43\", \"content\": \"Question: Does Horizon Bank currently provide a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account?\\n\\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_fc5a7921\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the schedule for interest credits on my Horizon Bank deposit account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Interest is posted to the account on a monthly basis.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_01a85fa7\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the schedule for interest credits on my Horizon Bank deposit account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Interest is posted to the account on a monthly basis.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ad98a5ba\", \"content\": \"Question: What are the details of Horizon Bank's Signature deposit plan?\\n\\nAnswer: - The Horizon Signature account provides a maximum annual interest of {{faq_ad98a5ba_001}} on the first {{faq_ad98a5ba_002}} million of your balance, composed of:\\n  • A base rate of {{faq_ad98a5ba_003}} per year, applied without any conditions;\\n  • A spend‑bonus of {{faq_ad98a5ba_004}} per year for Horizon Union members (or {{faq_ad98a5ba_005}} for non‑members) when you complete five qualifying {{faq_ad98a5ba_006}} card transactions in a month;\\n  • A balance‑bonus of {{faq_ad98a5ba_007}} per year once the account maintains an average daily balance of at least {{faq_ad98a5ba_008}} during the month;\\n  • A salary‑bonus of {{faq_ad98a5ba_009}} per year if a single GIRO credit of a minimum of {{faq_ad98a5ba_010}} is posted in the month.\\n- Any portion of the balance that exceeds {{faq_ad98a5ba_011}} million earns only the base rate of {{faq_ad98a5ba_012}} per year.\\n- Interest is credited to the account on the last day of each month.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its