{"timestamp": "2026-08-25T10:12:57.456+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_v3_verify_1787652742", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): What is my current loyalty tier, and what is the interest rate for my savings account?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Ben! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil these requests using the forms below.\n\nWould you like to continue discussing the interest rate for your savings account, and do you still want to complete your pending requests for Change Address and Resubmit KYC Document?\nUser: What is my current loyalty tier, and what is the interest rate for my savings account?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Check loyalty status through the rewards dashboard in the mobile application or online banking portal\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tiers are determined by total monthly spending and account balances held across eligible products\", \"conceptual\": \"A loyalty tier represents the status level assigned to customers based on their banking relationship depth\", \"target_commercial_product\": [\"Rewards_Program\", \"Deposit_Account\"], \"target_intent\": [\"Authentication And Security\", \"Features And Limits\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Branch And ATM Locator\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is my current loyalty tier?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is my current loyalty tier?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Check loyalty status through the rewards dashboard in the mobile application or online banking portal\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tiers are determined by total monthly spending and account balances held across eligible products\", \"conceptual\": \"A loyalty tier represents the status level assigned to customers based on their banking relationship depth\"}, {\"group_id\": \"retry_4\", \"procedural\": \"Review the specific savings plan details to identify applicable base rates and potential bonus interest criteria\", \"policy\": \"Interest rates for savings accounts are calculated based on monthly average balances and specific account plan types\", \"conceptual\": \"Savings account interest is determined by the combination of base rates and various balance or salary bonuses\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [\"faq_353df275\"], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss rewards program integration and card benefits, but none contain information on how to check the user's specific current loyalty tier.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}, {\"attempt\": 2, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"None of the provided parents contain information regarding how to check the user's current loyalty tier or the interest rate for their savings account.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}, {\"attempt\": 3, \"status\": \"PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"faq_353df275\"], \"reason\": \"The provided parents contain detailed information regarding the interest rates for savings accounts, which addresses one part of the user's request. However, none of the parents explain how the user can check their current loyalty tier.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_353df275\", \"fact\": \"Interest rates for savings accounts are determined by the specific savings plan, such as the Signature plan, and can include base, spend, balance, and salary bonuses.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_a3bab790\", \"fact\": \"Premium loyalty tier status is automatically upgraded based on maintaining a minimum Average Daily Balance in savings accounts combined with investment values.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7b5e0f27\", \"content\": \"Question: What three savings‑plan choices does Horizon Bank provide for its deposit accounts?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank now lets you select a savings plan that determines the interest applied to the balance in your savings account. The three available options are **Signature**, **Zen**, and **Flex**.\\n- You may switch your plan at any time before the month ends; the new selection takes effect on the {{faq_7b5e0f27_001}}st day of the following month.\\n- Each successful change triggers an in‑app push notification and an email alert.\\n- To see which plan is currently active, open the **Horizon App**, navigate to **Savings > Interest This Month**, where you can also monitor your progress toward any bonus interest tied to the chosen plan.\\n- If you do not make a change during a given month, the existing plan automatically rolls over into the next month.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_0b62be43\", \"content\": \"Question: Does Horizon Bank currently provide a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account?\\n\\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_1abf1754\", \"content\": \"Question: Which three savings‑plan choices does Horizon Bank provide for its savings accounts?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank now lets you pick a savings plan that determines the interest you earn on your deposited balance. The three available options are **Signature**, **Zen**, and **Flex**.\\n- You may switch plans at any point before the month ends; the new selection becomes active on the {{faq_1abf1754_001}}st day of the following month.\\n- Each successful change triggers a push notification and an email alert.\\n- To see which plan is currently in effect, open the Horizon App and navigate to **Savings > Interest this month**. This screen also displays your progress toward any bonus interest tied to the chosen plan.\\n- If you do not modify your plan during a given month, the existing plan automatically carries over into the next month.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_bf86ef1f\", \"content\": \"Question: How is the interest on a Horizon Bank Savings Account calculated and what can I expect to earn?\\n\\nAnswer: The return you receive depends on the savings plan attached to your account. If you have not selected a specific plan, Horizon Bank automatically enrolls you in the Signature plan. Under this plan you can earn up to {{faq_bf86ef1f_001}} per annum on the first {{faq_bf86ef1f_002}} of your savings balance, broken down as follows:\\n- **Base rate:** {{faq_bf86ef1f_003}} p.a. – applies to all balances without any conditions.\\n- **Spend‑bonus:**\\n  - {{faq_bf86ef1f_004}} p.a. for members of the Horizon Union, provided you complete at least five qualifying card purchases in the month.\\n  - {{faq_bf86ef1f_005}} p.a. for non‑Union members, also requiring five qualifying transactions.\\n- **Balance‑bonus:** {{faq_bf86ef1f_006}} p.a. when your average daily balance for the month reaches {{faq_bf86ef1f_007}} or more.\\n- **Salary‑bonus:** {{faq_bf86ef1f_008}} p.a. if you receive a minimum salary credit of {{faq_bf86ef1f_009}} in a single GIRO transaction (purpose code SALA) during the month.\\nAny amount exceeding {{faq_bf86ef1f_010}} earns only the base rate of {{faq_bf86ef1f_011}} p.a. Interest is posted on the final day of each month.\\n\\n**Illustrative calculation (December, {{faq_bf86ef1f_012}}‑day month):**\\nAssume you maintain a daily balance of {{faq_bf86ef1f_013}}, complete five qualifying card purchases of at least {{faq_bf86ef1f_014}} each on {{faq_bf86ef1f_015}} Dec, and have a {{faq_bf86ef1f_016}} salary credit on {{faq_bf86ef1f_017}} Dec.\\n- **Union member scenario**\\n  - Base on first {{faq_bf86ef1f_018}} M: {{faq_bf86ef1f_019}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_020}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_021}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_022}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_023}}\\n  - Spend‑bonus: {{faq_bf86ef1f_024}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_025}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_026}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_027}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_028}}\\n  - Balance‑bonus: {{faq_bf86ef1f_029}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_030}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_031}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_032}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_033}}\\n  - Salary‑bonus: {{faq_bf86ef1f_034}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_035}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_036}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_037}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_038}}\\n  - Base on excess {{faq_bf86ef1f_039}}: {{faq_bf86ef1f_040}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_041}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_042}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_043}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_044}}\\n  - **Total interest:** {{faq_bf86ef1f_045}}\\n- **Non‑Union member scenario**\\n  - Base on first {{faq_bf86ef1f_046}} M: {{faq_bf86ef1f_047}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_048}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_049}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_050}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_051}}\\n  - Spend‑bonus: {{faq_bf86ef1f_052}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_053}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_054}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_055}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_056}}\\n  - Balance‑bonus: {{faq_bf86ef1f_057}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_058}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_059}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_060}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_061}}\\n  - Salary‑bonus: {{faq_bf86ef1f_062}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_063}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_064}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_065}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_066}}\\n  - Base on excess {{faq_bf86ef1f_067}}: {{faq_bf86ef1f_068}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_069}} × {{faq_bf86ef1f_070}}/{{faq_bf86ef1f_071}} = {{faq_bf86ef1f_072}}\\n  - **Total interest:** {{faq_bf86ef1f_073}}\\n\\nThese figures are simplified for demonstration purposes.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_353df275\", \"content\": \"Question: What interest can I expect to earn on a Horizon Bank Savings Account?\\n\\nAnswer: - The rate you receive is tied to the savings plan you are enrolled in. If you have not selected a plan, Horizon Bank automatically places you in the Signature plan.\\n- Under the Signature plan you may earn a combined interest of up to {{faq_353df275_001}} per annum on the first {{faq_353df275_002}} of your savings balance. The rate is broken down as follows:\\n  * Base interest: {{faq_353df275_003}} p.a. (no conditions).\\n  * Spend bonus: {{faq_353df275_004}} p.a. for Horizon Union members or {{faq_353df275_005}} p.a. for non‑members, provided you complete at least five qualifying card transactions each month.\\n  * Balance bonus: {{faq_353df275_006}} p.a. when your average daily balance for the month reaches {{faq_353df275_007}}.\\n  * Salary bonus: {{faq_353df275_008}} p.a. if a minimum salary credit of {{faq_353df275_009}} is posted in a single GIRO transaction with purpose code SALA during the month.\\n- Any amount above {{faq_353df275_010}} accrues only the base rate of {{faq_353df275_011}} p.a.\\n- Interest is credited on the last day of each month.\\n\\n**Illustrative example (December, {{faq_353df275_012}}‑day month)**\\nAssume you maintain a daily balance of {{faq_353df275_013}}, execute five qualifying card purchases of at least {{faq_353df275_014}} each on {{faq_353df275_015}} Dec, and receive a {{faq_353df275_016}} salary credit on {{faq_353df275_017}} Dec.\\n\\n*For Horizon Union members:*\\n  - Base on first {{faq_353df275_018}} M: {{faq_353df275_019}} × {{faq_353df275_020}} × {{faq_353df275_021}}/{{faq_353df275_022}} = {{faq_353df275_023}}\\n  - Spend bonus: {{faq_353df275_024}} × {{faq_353df275_025}} × {{faq_353df275_026}}/{{faq_353df275_027}} = {{faq_353df275_028}}\\n  - Balance bonus: {{faq_