least five qualifying card transactions each month.\\n  * Balance bonus: {{faq_353df275_006}} p.a. when your average daily balance for the month reaches {{faq_353df275_007}}.\\n  * Salary bonus: {{faq_353df275_008}} p.a. if a minimum salary credit of {{faq_353df275_009}} is posted in a single GIRO transaction with purpose code SALA during the month.\\n- Any amount above {{faq_353df275_010}} accrues only the base rate of {{faq_353df275_011}} p.a.\\n- Interest is credited on the last day of each month.\\n\\n**Illustrative example (December, {{faq_353df275_012}}‑day month)**\\nAssume you maintain a daily balance of {{faq_353df275_013}}, execute five qualifying card purchases of at least {{faq_353df275_014}} each on {{faq_353df275_015}} Dec, and receive a {{faq_353df275_016}} salary credit on {{faq_353df275_017}} Dec.\\n\\n*For Horizon Union members:*\\n  - Base on first {{faq_353df275_018}} M: {{faq_353df275_019}} × {{faq_353df275_020}} × {{faq_353df275_021}}/{{faq_353df275_022}} = {{faq_353df275_023}}\\n  - Spend bonus: {{faq_353df275_024}} × {{faq_353df275_025}} × {{faq_353df275_026}}/{{faq_353df275_027}} = {{faq_353df275_028}}\\n  - Balance bonus: {{faq_353df275_029}} × {{faq_353df275_030}} × {{faq_353df275_031}}/{{faq_353df275_032}} = {{faq_353df275_033}}\\n  - Salary bonus: {{faq_353df275_034}} × {{faq_353df275_035}} × {{faq_353df275_036}}/{{faq_353df275_037}} = {{faq_353df275_038}}\\n  - Base on excess {{faq_353df275_039}}: {{faq_353df275_040}} × {{faq_353df275_041}} × {{faq_353df275_042}}/{{faq_353df275_043}} = {{faq_353df275_044}}\\n  - **Total interest = {{faq_353df275_045}}**\\n\\n*For non‑Union members:*\\n  - Base on first {{faq_353df275_046}} M: {{faq_353df275_047}} × {{faq_353df275_048}} × {{faq_353df275_049}}/{{faq_353df275_050}} = {{faq_353df275_051}}\\n  - Spend bonus: {{faq_353df275_052}} × {{faq_353df275_053}} × {{faq_353df275_054}}/{{faq_353df275_055}} = {{faq_353df275_056}}\\n  - Balance bonus: {{faq_353df275_057}} × {{faq_353df275_058}} × {{faq_35