ty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Update your registered residential address by logging into the mobile app profile settings menu\", \"policy\": \"Customers must provide valid proof of residence documentation to verify any changes to address\", \"conceptual\": \"The registered address is the primary location used for all official bank correspondence and statements\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Application\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Branch And ATM Locator\", \"Card Logistics\", \"Eligibility\", \"Features And Limits\", \"Fees And Charges\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Interest And Rates\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rewards And Promotions\", \"Transaction Disputes\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the address on file for the customer?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the address on file for the customer?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Update your registered residential address by logging into the mobile app profile settings menu\", \"policy\": \"Customers must provide valid proof of residence documentation to verify any changes to address\", \"conceptual\": \"The registered address is the primary location used for all official bank correspondence and statements\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents describe the procedure for changing an address, but do not contain information regarding the customer's current address on file.\", \"evidence_delta\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e2d941d\", \"fact\": \"Address modifications for Singapore residents must be submitted through Singpass.\"}]}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_