fers\", \"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the customer's current loyalty tier?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the customer's current loyalty tier?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"View your current loyalty status and progress toward the next tier within the rewards dashboard\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tiers are determined by total monthly transaction volume and average daily account balances maintained\", \"conceptual\": \"Loyalty tiers provide tiered access to exclusive banking benefits and enhanced reward point earning rates\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"The provided parents discuss savings plans, interest rates, and loyalty program integration, but do not contain information about the customer's current loyalty tier.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_8d322d06\", \"content\": \"Question: What range of financial products and services does Horizon Bank provide to its customers?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank is pleased to introduce an initial suite of products, including a Horizon credit card, a savings account, and personal accident insurance for families. These offerings are complemented by a best-in-class rewards and loyalty program, seamlessly integrated with the FairPrice Group ecosystem. Furthermore, Horizon Bank has collaborated with prominent brands such as KFC, Starbucks, Viu, and Caltex to bring exclusive deals, providing our customers with additional savings opportunities. This marks the beginning of our product development journey, and we look forward to working closely with our customers to further enhance and expand our offerings.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_13c2c54b\", \"content\": \"Question: I've noticed that I can save or unsave certain digital vouchers through the Horizon App, but not all of the