{"timestamp": "2026-08-25T10:30:55.463+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_cc62ff70-479d-4c0f-9a59-a2e53f4ab230", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account. Can you show me how to replace a credit card. Also i demand change my address.\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Ben! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil these requests using the forms below.\n\nWould you like to continue updating your address, and do you still want to complete your pending requests for Change Address and Resubmit KYC Document?\nUser: What is my current loyalty tier, and what is the interest rate for my savings account?\nAI: Your current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟. Regarding your savings account interest rate, the rate you receive is tied to the savings plan you are enrolled in. If you have not selected a plan, Horizon Bank automatically places you in the Signature plan. Under the Signature plan, you may earn a combined interest of up to 1% per annum (yearly interest expressed as a percentage of your balance) on the first S$1,200,000 of your savings balance. At present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account\nAI: Your address on file is {{data-f62cb908}} 🏠, and your current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟. Regarding the interest rate for your savings account, at present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account. Can you show me how to replace a credit card. Also i demand change my address.\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to profile settings to view the residential address currently registered with the bank\", \"policy\": \"Address records must be kept current to ensure receipt of all official bank correspondence\", \"conceptual\": \"The registered address is the primary location associated with your account for all legal communications\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Horizon_APP\", \"target_intent\": [\"General Inquiries\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is my current address on file?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is my current address on file?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Navigate to profile settings to view the residential address currently registered with the bank\", \"policy\": \"Address records must be kept current to ensure receipt of all official bank correspondence\", \"conceptual\": \"The registered address is the primary location associated with your account for all legal communications\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e2d941d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my home address when applying for a Horizon Bank account?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Singapore citizens and Permanent Residents (effective {{faq_6e2d941d_001}} Oct {{faq_6e2d941d_002}})**: All address modifications must be submitted through Singpass. Steps:\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_003}}. Sign in to Singpass and choose your language.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_004}}. Verify that the details entered in your Horizon Bank application are accurate before proceeding.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_005}}. Submit the request; ICA will mail a {{faq_6e2d941d_006}}‑digit PIN to your new residence.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_007}}. For local addresses, the PIN letter typically arrives within one week.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_008}}. Use the PIN to continue your Horizon Bank onboarding via the ICA e‑Service portal. (Further guidance available via the provided link.)\\n- **Non‑Singapore residents**:\\n  - *Option {{faq_6e2d941d_009}}*: Access the myTax Portal with your Singpass or Singpass Foreign Account (SFA), select “Update Contact Details,” and amend your residential or mailing address. The update is reflected within three business days. (More information at the linked page.)\\n  - *Option {{faq_6e2d941d_010}}*: Go to the Ministry of Manpower (MoM) website and follow these actions:\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_011}}. Click “Log in for EP Online with Singpass” under the pass‑holder section.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_012}}. Log in using your Singpass credentials.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_013}}. Choose “Change Particulars – Personal Contact Details and Residential Address of Pass Holder.”\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_014}}. Input your Main Pass ID and search.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_015}}. Edit the residential postal address and save the changes.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_24568045\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my personal details—address, phone number, or email—within the Horizon ecosystem?\\n\\nAnswer: - Updating your personal information can now be done directly through the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n{{faq_24568045_002}}. Tap the Profile icon located at the upper‑right corner.\\n{{faq_24568045_003}}. Within Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\\n{{faq_24568045_004}}. Choose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email).\\n{{faq_24568045_005}}. For phone number or email changes, enter the one‑time password (OTP) sent to you.\\n{{faq_24568045_006}}. Provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied.\\n{{faq_24568045_007}}. After you submit, the change will be processed within {{faq_24568045_008}} hours for phone numbers and email addresses, while address updates take effect instantly.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_717608ab\", \"content\": \"Question: In which section of the Horizon App should I enter my referral code?\\n\\nAnswer: - Launch the Horizon App, pick your preferred language, and tap “Get started” to begin the onboarding process.\\n- When prompted, type in your referral code.\\n- After completing registration, the referral bonus will be credited to your account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ce650cb6\", \"content\": \"Question: If I change my mobile number, will the previous number linked to PayNow be removed automatically?\\n\\nAnswer: - No, the old mobile number stays active in PayNow until you manually remove it. You can deregister it from the Horizon App using either of the following methods:\\n\\na) Via the Payments area:\\n   • Open the app and go to Money → Payments → Settings (tap the three‑dot icon).\\n   • Select PayNow Registration → Your registered mobile number → Deregister mobile number.\\n\\nb) While updating your contact information:\\n   • Go to Profile → Settings → Personal Details.\\n   • Edit the phone number, submit the change, then choose to deregister the previous number from PayNow.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Check your current status level by accessing the rewards dashboard within the mobile banking application\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tiers are determined based on your total banking relationship and account activity levels\", \"conceptual\": \"The loyalty tier system provides tiered benefits and rewards based on your engagement with bank services\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Rewards_Program\", \"target_intent\": [\"General Inquiries\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is my current loyalty tier?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is my current loyalty tier?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Check your current status level by accessing the rewards dashboard within the mobile banking application\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tiers are determined based on your total banking relationship and account activity levels\", \"conceptual\": \"The loyalty tier system provides tiered benefits and rewards based on your engagement with bank services\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_8d322d06\", \"content\": \"Question: What range of financial products and services does Horizon Bank provide to its customers?\\n\\nAnswer: Horizon Bank is pleased to introduce an initial suite of products, including a Horizon credit card, a savings account, and personal accident insurance for families. These offerings are complemented by a best-in-class rewards and loyalty program, seamlessly integrated with the FairPrice Group ecosystem. Furthermore, Horizon Bank has collaborated with prominent brands such as KFC, Starbucks, Viu, and Caltex to bring exclusive deals, providing our customers with additional savings opportunities. This marks the beginning of our product development journey, and we look forward to working closely with our customers to further enhance and expand our offerings.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_353df275\", \"content\": \"Question: What interest can I expect to earn on a Horizon Bank Savings Account?\\n\\nAnswer: - The rate you receive is tied to the savings plan you are enrolled in. If you have not selected a plan, Horizon Bank automatically places you in the Signature plan.\\n- Under the Signature plan you may earn a combined interest of up to {{faq_353df275_001}} per annum on the first {{faq_353df275_002}} of your savings balance. The rate is broken down as follows:\\n  * Base interest: {{faq_353df275_003}} p.a. (no conditions).\\n  * Spend bonus: {{faq_353df275_004}} p.a. for Horizon Union members or {{faq_353df275_005}} p.a. for non‑members, provided you complete at least five qualifying card transactions each month.\\n  * Balance bonus: {{faq_353df275_006}} p.a. when your average daily balance for the month reaches {{faq_353df275_007}}.\\n  * Salary bonus: {{faq_353df275_008}} p.a. if a minimum salary credit of {{faq_353df275_009}} is posted in a single GIRO transaction with purpose code SALA during the month.\\n- Any amount above {{faq_353df275_010}} accrues only the base rate of {{faq_353df275_011}} p.a.\\n- Interest is credited on the last day of each month.\\n\\n**Illustrative example (December, {{faq_353df275_012}}‑day month)**\\nAssume you maintain a daily balance of {{faq_353df275_013}}, execute five qualifying card purchases of at least {{faq_353df275_014}} each on {{faq_353df275_015}} Dec, and receive a {{faq_353df275_016}} salary credit on {{faq_353df275_017}} Dec.\\n\\n*For Horizon Union members:*\\n  - Base on first {{faq_353df275_018}} M: {{faq_353df275_019}} × {{faq_353df275_020}} × {{faq_353df275_021}}/{{faq_353df275_022}} = {{faq_353df275_023}}\\n  - Spend bonus: {{faq_353df275_024}} × {{faq_353df275_025}} × {{faq_353df275_026}}/{{faq_353df275_027}} = {{faq_353df275_028}}\\n  - Balance bonus: {{faq_353df275_029}} × {{faq_353df275_030}} × {{faq_353df275_031}}/{{faq_353df275_032}} = {{faq_353df275_033}}\\n  - Salary bonus: {{faq_353df275_034}} × {{faq_353df275_035}} × {{faq_353df275_036}}/{{faq_353df275_037}} = {{faq_353df275_038}}\\n  - Base on excess {{faq_353df275_039}}: {{faq_353df275_040}} × {{faq_353df275_041}} × {{faq_353df275_042}}/{{faq_353df275_043}} = {{faq_353df275_044}}\\n  - **Total interest = {{faq_353df275_045}}**\\n\\n*For non‑Union members:*\\n  - Base on first {{faq_353df275_046}} M: {{faq_353df275_047}} × {{faq_353df275_048}} × {{faq_353df275_049}}/{{faq_353df275_050}} = {{faq_353df275_051}}\\n  - Spend bonus: {{faq_353df275_052}} × {{faq_353df275_053}} × {{faq_353df275_054}}/{{faq_353df275_055}} = {{faq_353df275_056}}\\n  - Balance bonus: {{faq_353df275_057}} × {{faq_353df275_058}} × {{faq_353df275_059}}/{{faq_353df275_060}} = {{faq_353df275_061}}\\n  - Salary bonus: {{faq_353df275_062}} × {{faq_353df275_063}} × {{faq_353df275_064}}/{{faq_353df275_065}} = {{faq_353df275_066}}\\n  - Base on excess {{faq_353df275_067}}: {{faq_353df275_068}} × {{faq_353df275_069}} × {{faq_353df275_070}}/{{faq_353df275_071}} = {{faq_353df275_072}}\\n  - **Total interest = {{faq_353df275_073}}**\\n\\n*Note: The figures above are simplified for illustration purposes.*\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_fcbafd91\", \"content\": \"Question: How can I view the preferred category I have set?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, navigate to **Rewards** > **Cashback**, where your selected preferred category will be displayed.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7b5e0f27\", \"content\": \"Question: What three savings‑plan choices does Horizon Bank provide for its deposit accounts?\\n\\nAnswer: - Horizon Bank now lets you select a savings plan that determines the interest applied to the balance in your savings account. The three available options are **Signature**, **Zen**, and **Flex**.\\n- You may switch your plan at any time before the month ends; the new selection takes effect on the {{faq_7b5e0f27_001}}st day of the following month.\\n- Each successful change triggers an in‑app push notification and an email alert.\\n- To see which plan is currently active, open the **Horizon App**, navigate to **Savings > Interest This Month**, where you can also monitor your progress toward any bonus interest tied to the chosen plan.\\n- If you do not make a change during a given month, the existing plan automatically rolls over into the next month.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_3\", \"procedural\": \"View the specific interest rate applied to your savings balance through the account details screen\", \"policy\": \"Interest rates are subject to the terms of your specific savings plan and account balance\", \"conceptual\": \"The interest rate represents the annual percentage yield earned on your deposited funds over time\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Deposit_Account\", \"target_intent\": [\"Interest And Rates\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is the interest rate for my savings account?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is the interest rate for my savings account?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_3\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"View the specific interest rate applied to your savings balance through the account details screen\", \"policy\": \"Interest rates are subject to the terms of your specific savings plan and account balance\", \"conceptual\": \"The interest rate represents the annual percentage yield earned on your deposited funds over time\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_0b62be43\", \"content\": \"Question: Does Horizon Bank currently provide a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account?\\n\\nAnswer: - At present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_353df275\", \"content\": \"Question: What interest can I expect to earn on a Horizon Bank Savings Account?\\n\\nAnswer: - The rate you receive is tied to the savings plan you are enrolled in. If you have not selected a plan, Horizon Bank automatically places you in the Signature plan.\\n- Under the Signature plan you may earn a combined interest of up to {{faq_353df275_001}} per annum on the first {{faq_353df275_002}} of your savings balance. The rate is broken down as follows:\\n  * Base interest: {{faq_353df275_003}} p.a. (no conditions).\\n  * Spend bonus: {{faq_353df275_004}} p.a. for Horizon Union members or {{faq_353df275_005}} p.a. for non‑members, provided you complete at least five qualifying card transactions each month.\\n  * Balance bonus: {{faq_353df275_006}} p.a. when your average daily balance for the month reaches {{faq_353df275_007}}.\\n  * Salary bonus: {{faq_353df275_008}} p.a. if a minimum salary credit of {{faq_353df275_009}} is posted in a single GIRO transaction with purpose code SALA during the month.\\n- Any amount above {{faq_353df275_010}} accrues only the base rate of {{faq_353df275_011}} p.a.\\n- Interest is credited on the last day of each month.\\n\\n**Illustrative example (December, {{faq_353df275_012}}‑day month)**\\nAssume you maintain a daily balance of {{faq_353df275_013}}, execute five qualifying card purchases of at least {{faq_353df275_014}} each on {{faq_353df275_015}} Dec, and receive a {{faq_353df275_016}} salary credit on {{faq_353df275_017}} Dec.\\n\\n*For Horizon Union members:*\\n  - Base on first {{faq_353df275_018}} M: {{faq_353df275_019}} × {{faq_353df275_020}} × {{faq_353df275_021}}/{{faq_353df275_022}} = {{faq_353df275_023}}\\n  - Spend bonus: {{faq_353df275_024}} × {{faq_353df275_025}} × {{faq_353df275_026}}/{{faq_353df275_027}} = {{faq_353df275_028}}\\n  - Balance bonus: {{faq_353df275_029}} × {{faq_353df275_030}} × {{faq_353df275_031}}/{{faq_353df275_032}} = {{faq_353df275_033}}\\n  - Salary bonus: {{faq_353df275_034}} × {{faq_353df275_035}} × {{faq_353df275_036}}/{{faq_353df275_037}} = {{faq_353df275_038}}\\n  - Base on excess {{faq_353df275_039}}: {{faq_353df275_040}} × {{faq_353df275_041}} × {{faq_353df275_042}}/{{faq_353df275_043}} = {{faq_353df275_044}}\\n  - **Total interest = {{faq_353df275_045}}**\\n\\n*For non‑Union members:*\\n  - Base on first {{faq_353df275_046}} M: {{faq_353df275_047}} × {{faq_353df275_048}} × {{faq_353df275_049}}/{{faq_353df275_050}} = {{faq_353df275_051}}\\n  - Spend bonus: {{faq_353df275_052}} × {{faq_353df275_053}} × {{faq_353df275_054}}/{{faq_353df275_055}} = {{faq_353df275_056}}\\n  - Balance bonus: {{faq_353df275_057}} × {{faq_353df275_058}} × {{faq_353df275_059}}/{{faq_353df275_060}} = {{faq_353df275_061}}\\n  - Salary bonus: {{faq_353df275_062}} × {{faq_353df275_063}} × {{faq_353df275_064}}/{{faq_353df275_065}} = {{faq_353df275_066}}\\n  - Base on excess {{faq_353df275_067}}: {{faq_353df275_068}} × {{faq_353df275_069}} × {{faq_353df275_070}}/{{faq_353df275_071}} = {{faq_353df275_072}}\\n  - **Total interest = {{faq_353df275_073}}**\\n\\n*Note: The figures above are simplified for illustration purposes.*\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_fc5a7921\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the schedule for interest credits on my Horizon Bank deposit account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Interest is posted to the account on a monthly basis.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_01a85fa7\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the schedule for interest credits on my Horizon Bank deposit account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Interest is posted to the account on a monthly basis.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_4\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_4\", \"procedural\": \"Report the card as lost or damaged via the mobile app to initiate a replacement request\", \"policy\": \"Replacement cards are issued to the registered mailing address following verification of the request\", \"conceptual\": \"A replacement card is a new physical card issued when the original is lost or damaged\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\"], \"customer_component\": \"How do I replace a credit card?\", \"direct_query\": \"How do I replace a credit card?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_4\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Report the card as lost or damaged via the mobile app to initiate a replacement request\", \"policy\": \"Replacement cards are issued to the registered mailing address following verification of the request\", \"conceptual\": \"A replacement card is a new physical card issued when the original is lost or damaged\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_98eb6af4\", \"content\": \"Question: I'm currently using my Horizon Link Credit/Debit Card, but my Horizon App displays the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card. How can I obtain a physical version of the NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card?\\n\\nAnswer: To receive a physical NTUC Link Credit/Debit Card, you'll need to initiate a lost card replacement process through the Horizon App. It's essential to choose the correct replacement option, as selecting 'damaged card' will not yield the desired outcome. Please be aware that replacing your card will result in changes to your card details, including the card number, CVV, and expiry date. Consequently, you will need to update your card information for any existing online credit card arrangements, such as card-on-file and recurring payments, to ensure uninterrupted service.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_a2a2d70f\", \"content\": \"Question: My credit card was approved through the online portal, but I haven’t installed the Horizon App yet. How do I begin using the card?\\n\\nAnswer: - After your application is approved, download the Horizon App and sign in with MyInfo to activate the card.\\n- Once logged in you can:\\n  - Access your digital card information instantly.\\n  - Enable your physical Horizon card when it arrives.\\nYour physical card will be mailed to the address on file within {{faq_a2a2d70f_001}} business days of approval.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_5\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_5\", \"procedural\": \"Update your residential address by submitting a formal request through the profile management section\", \"policy\": \"Address changes require valid proof of residence documentation to be processed by the bank\", \"conceptual\": \"Updating your address ensures that all bank statements and notices are delivered to the correct location\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Horizon_APP\", \"target_intent\": [\"Profile Updates\"], \"customer_component\": \"Change my address.\", \"direct_query\": \"Change my address.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_5\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Update your residential address by submitting a formal request through the profile management section\", \"policy\": \"Address changes require valid proof of residence documentation to be processed by the bank\", \"conceptual\": \"Updating your address ensures that all bank statements and notices are delivered to the correct location\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_6e2d941d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the procedure for changing my home address when applying for a Horizon Bank account?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Singapore citizens and Permanent Residents (effective {{faq_6e2d941d_001}} Oct {{faq_6e2d941d_002}})**: All address modifications must be submitted through Singpass. Steps:\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_003}}. Sign in to Singpass and choose your language.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_004}}. Verify that the details entered in your Horizon Bank application are accurate before proceeding.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_005}}. Submit the request; ICA will mail a {{faq_6e2d941d_006}}‑digit PIN to your new residence.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_007}}. For local addresses, the PIN letter typically arrives within one week.\\n  {{faq_6e2d941d_008}}. Use the PIN to continue your Horizon Bank onboarding via the ICA e‑Service portal. (Further guidance available via the provided link.)\\n- **Non‑Singapore residents**:\\n  - *Option {{faq_6e2d941d_009}}*: Access the myTax Portal with your Singpass or Singpass Foreign Account (SFA), select “Update Contact Details,” and amend your residential or mailing address. The update is reflected within three business days. (More information at the linked page.)\\n  - *Option {{faq_6e2d941d_010}}*: Go to the Ministry of Manpower (MoM) website and follow these actions:\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_011}}. Click “Log in for EP Online with Singpass” under the pass‑holder section.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_012}}. Log in using your Singpass credentials.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_013}}. Choose “Change Particulars – Personal Contact Details and Residential Address of Pass Holder.”\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_014}}. Input your Main Pass ID and search.\\n    {{faq_6e2d941d_015}}. Edit the residential postal address and save the changes.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contains `task.customer_component`: the intent\n          formulator's resolved sub-query for that task. Evaluate a task ONLY\n          against its own `customer_component` and that task's candidate\n          parents.\n        - Each Task Input may include `prior_sufficiency_audit_history` from\n          earlier attempts for the same task in this turn. Read it before\n          judging the current candidates and remain consistent with its prior\n          sufficiency judgments. This history is internal audit context only;\n          it is not customer-facing evidence and does not authorize any new\n          factual claim.\n        - Classify each task as SUFFICIENT, PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT, or\n          INSUFFICIENT. Judge whether the supplied parents provide useful,\n          materially relevant information for the task—not whether they repeat\n          the customer's wording or explicitly resolve every possible\n          interpretation of the customer's question.\n        - PARTIAL-EVIDENCE DECISION ORDER: First identify whether any supplied\n          parent contains a factual proposition directly relevant to a\n          meaningful aspect of the customer's resolved request. If one does,\n          do not return INSUFFICIENT merely because the parent cannot determine\n          the customer's requested outcome, permission, eligibility,\n          exception, legality, preferred action, or other broader conclusion.\n          Retain that parent as PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT when its supported fact\n          can be truthfully presented as useful, bounded Horizon guidance\n          while another material aspect remains unresolved. Continue retrieval\n          for the unresolved aspect.\n        - Return INSUFFICIENT only when no supplied parent contains any\n          factual proposition that can be truthfully and materially presented\n          in relation to the resolved request. A parent is not material merely\n          because it concerns the same product: its supported fact must\n          directly concern the same topic, condition, process, boundary, or\n          factual premise in the customer's request.\n        - SUFFICIENT: the selected parents contain enough grounded information\n          for a useful response to the `customer_component`, even when that\n          response is an explicit policy boundary, limit, condition,\n          restriction, or other related factual information rather than a\n          literal yes/no answer. The response generator will state only what\n          the evidence supports and must not invent a broader conclusion.\n        \nPRECISION REFERENCE CONTRACT:\n- A token matching `{{faq_*}}` is a database-backed exact-value reference,\n  never missing, unknown, incomplete, or a customer-visible template.\n- It may represent an exact amount, rate, limit, date, threshold, or other\n  precise value. Treat it as the underlying approved fact for relevance,\n  sufficiency, generation, compliance, and groundedness.\n- Preserve the token exactly in any draft. The backend deterministically\n  substitutes its authoritative value only after outbound validation.\n- Never reject, weaken, or describe evidence as unavailable merely because the\n  exact value is represented by a `{{faq_*}}` token.\n- Within the stated scope, \"up to {{faq_*}}\" expresses an exact maximum. It\n  supports the bounded conclusion that the stated coverage or benefit does not\n  exceed that value. It does not, by itself, support claims about applications,\n  approvals, denials, exceptions, or who controls the limit.\n\n        - PARTIALLY_SUFFICIENT: selected parents provide grounded, material\n          information for one meaningful part of the `customer_component`,\n          while another material part has no useful related evidence. Select\n          only the supporting parent IDs; the backend will r