{"timestamp": "2026-08-25T10:30:59.364+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_cc62ff70-479d-4c0f-9a59-a2e53f4ab230", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account. Can you show me how to replace a credit card. Also i demand change my address.\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Ben! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil these requests using the forms below.\n\nWould you like to continue updating your address, and do you still want to complete your pending requests for Change Address and Resubmit KYC Document?\nUser: What is my current loyalty tier, and what is the interest rate for my savings account?\nAI: Your current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟. Regarding your savings account interest rate, the rate you receive is tied to the savings plan you are enrolled in. If you have not selected a plan, Horizon Bank automatically places you in the Signature plan. Under the Signature plan, you may earn a combined interest of up to 1% per annum (yearly interest expressed as a percentage of your balance) on the first S$1,200,000 of your savings balance. At present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account\nAI: Your address on file is {{data-f62cb908}} 🏠, and your current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟. Regarding the interest rate for your savings account, at present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account. Can you show me how to replace a credit card. Also i demand change my address.\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"Check your current status level by accessing the rewards dashboard within the mobile banking application\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tiers are determined based on your total banking relationship and account activity levels\", \"conceptual\": \"The loyalty tier system provides tiered benefits and rewards based on your engagement with bank services\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Rewards_Program\", \"target_intent\": [\"Authentication And Security\", \"Features And Limits\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Rewards And Promotions\"], \"customer_component\": \"What is my current loyalty tier?\", \"direct_query\": \"What is my current loyalty tier?\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_2\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Check your current status level by accessing the rewards dashboard within the mobile banking application\", \"policy\": \"Loyalty tiers are determined based on your total banking relationship and account activity levels\", \"conceptual\": \"The loyalty tier system provides tiered benefits and rewards based on your engagement with bank services\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [{\"attempt\": 1, \"status\": \"INSUFFICIENT\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [], \"reason\": \"None of the provided parents contain information on how to check the current loyalty tier; they focus on savings plans, rewards categories, or general product suites.\", \"evidence_delta\": []}], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_8065dd4a\", \"content\": \"Question: What steps can I take to integrate my loyalty program membership with the Horizon Bank partner merchant application?\\n\\nAnswer: To establish a connection between your membership and the partner app, kindly refer to the comprehensive guide available at the Horizon Bank support portal, which outlines the straightforward process for linking your accounts and unlocking exclusive rewards.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_5a7395a4\", \"content\": \"Question: How do I qualify for and receive the quarterly bonus Linkpoints on my FairPrice Group purchases made with my Horizon card?\\n\\nAnswer: To be eligible for the quarterly bonus Linkpoints on your FairPrice Group spend, you must first meet the minimum monthly spend requirement for three consecutive months, starting from the month your Horizon card is approved. The required spend amounts are {{faq_5a7395a4_001}} for NTUC Link Credit cardholders, {{faq_5a7395a4_002}} for Horizon Link Credit cardholders, or {{faq_5a7395a4_003}} for NTUC Link Debit and Horizon Link Debit cardholders, based on the posting date of your transactions. Once you've met this condition, you'll receive the quarterly bonus Linkpoints on all your posted FairPrice Group spend. Additionally, if you meet the higher minimum monthly spend of {{faq_5a7395a4_004}} for NTUC Link Credit and Horizon Link Credit cardholders, or {{faq_5a7395a4_005}} for NTUC Link Debit and Horizon Link Debit cardholders, you'll be eligible for an extra quarterly bonus. The FairPrice Group spend includes purchases made at FairPrice, FairPrice Finest, FairPrice Xtra, FairPrice Online, Warehouse Club, Unity, and Cheers stores, as well as participating Kopitiam stalls, excluding FairPrice Xpress and Cheers outlets within Esso stations. You will receive the quarterly bonus Linkpoints on your FairPrice Group spend once the transactions are posted in the month.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_da866599\", \"content\": \"Question: As a current member of the rewards program, will my existing membership automatically connect to my Horizon Bank card?\\n\\nAnswer: Indeed, upon approval of your application, your existing rewards membership will be seamlessly integrated with your new Horizon card. This integration enables you to accumulate rewards points through your debit or credit card transactions and conveniently monitor your points balance and transaction history within the Horizon App.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_68f6ae39\", \"content\": \"Question: What effects will the upcoming modifications have on my Horizon Bank account and PayNow transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: You do not need to take any steps in response to these changes. The process of sending and receiving funds through PayNow will remain unaffected for both personal and corporate users. Your existing PayNow proxies, including your mobile number, NRIC/FIN, and Virtual Payment Address (VPA), will continue to function as they do now. Starting from {{faq_68f6ae39_001}} June {{faq_68f6ae39_002}}, when someone uses PayNow to send you money through the Horizon App, they will see a partial display of your name, enhancing the payment experience.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_5\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_5\", \"procedural\": \"Update your residential address by submitting a formal request through the profile management section\", \"policy\": \"Address changes require valid proof of residence documentation to be processed by the bank\", \"conceptual\": \"Updating your address ensures that all bank statements and notices are delivered to the correct location\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Horizon_APP\", \"target_intent\": [\"Account Management\", \"Authentication And Security\", \"Features And Limits\", \"General Inquiries\", \"Payments And Transfers\", \"Profile Updates\", \"Rew