{"timestamp": "2026-08-25T13:21:50.157+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_cc62ff70-479d-4c0f-9a59-a2e53f4ab230", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): is your manage card can directly mange my card?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Ben! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil these requests using the forms below.\n\nWould you like to continue updating your address, and do you still want to complete your pending requests for Change Address and Resubmit KYC Document?\nUser: What is my current loyalty tier, and what is the interest rate for my savings account?\nAI: Your current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟. Regarding your savings account interest rate, the rate you receive is tied to the savings plan you are enrolled in. If you have not selected a plan, Horizon Bank automatically places you in the Signature plan. Under the Signature plan, you may earn a combined interest of up to 1% per annum (yearly interest expressed as a percentage of your balance) on the first S$1,200,000 of your savings balance. At present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account\nAI: Your address on file is {{data-f62cb908}} 🏠, and your current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟. Regarding the interest rate for your savings account, at present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account. Can you show me how to replace a credit card. Also i demand change my address.\nAI: Your address on file is {{data-c7f6ec3e}} 🏠.\n\nYour current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟.\n\nRegarding the interest rate for your savings account, at present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\n\nAccess your Horizon App account.\n\nNavigate to the 'Card Management' section.\n\nChoose the 'Replace Current Card' option.\n\nIndicate that your card is damaged to complete the request.\n\nSign in to the Horizon App.\n\nTap the Profile icon located at the upper-right corner.\n\nWithin Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\n\nChoose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email), and provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied. Address updates take effect instantly.\n\nIf you'd like to skip the manual steps, you can also update your address or manage your cards directly using the shortcuts below.\nUser: thank you,, that was very informative\nAI: You're very welcome! 😊 Let me know if you need assistance with anything else.\nUser: can you explain the credit card replace part in more details?\nAI: Here are the detailed steps to obtain a replacement card if your Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage or if you need to replace it:\n\nAccess your Horizon App account.\n\nNavigate to the 'Card Management' section.\n\nChoose the 'Replace Current Card' option.\n\nIndicate that your card is damaged to complete the request.\n\nAdditionally, for a card that is lost or stolen, you can first freeze it by opening the card dashboard 