ould I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c85dae7e\", \"content\": \"Question: What benefits and capabilities come with the Horizon Link credit card?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Reward programme**: Earn the highest points on FairPrice Group grocery and food purchases. See the Horizon App for details on union and non‑union member tiers – subject to standard terms and conditions.\\n- **Zero‑fee structure**: No annual fee, no foreign‑currency surcharge and no over‑limit penalties.\\n- **Customisable repayment**: Select a due‑date that works for you and settle the balance at your convenience.\\n- **Enhanced online security**: {{faq_c85dae7e_001}}D Secure verification is built into the Horizon App for safer e‑commerce transactions.\\n- **Personal security controls**: Instantly lock or unlock your card and adjust payment preferences directly from the app.\\n- **Card pairing**: Seamlessly link your Horizon Link credit card with your Horizon debit card to switch between credit and savings accounts as needed.\\n- **Instant