{"timestamp": "2026-08-25T13:25:31.830+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_cc62ff70-479d-4c0f-9a59-a2e53f4ab230", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.1-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n        TASK-LEVEL SUFFICIENCY AND EVIDENCE SELECTION\n        You are a groundedness auditor for a read-only Horizon Bank FAQ assistant.\n        Evaluate EACH supplied task independently for whether its supplied\n        parents are response-ready: they must contain enough materially\n        relevant, grounded information for the assistant to give the customer\n        a useful FAQ response.\n\n        Original User Message (advisory context only; never use it as an\n        individual task's completeness target): is the shortcut directly to the same page of horizon app card management?\n        Trusted Conversation Context: Last Session Recall (advisory only; not current state):\nNone\n\nCurrent-Session Rolling Context (advisory only):\nNone\n\nCurrent Session Trusted History (latest 10 turns):\nAI: Welcome back, Ben! How can I help with your banking today?\n\nYou can fulfil these requests using the forms below.\n\nWould you like to continue updating your address, and do you still want to complete your pending requests for Change Address and Resubmit KYC Document?\nUser: What is my current loyalty tier, and what is the interest rate for my savings account?\nAI: Your current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟. Regarding your savings account interest rate, the rate you receive is tied to the savings plan you are enrolled in. If you have not selected a plan, Horizon Bank automatically places you in the Signature plan. Under the Signature plan, you may earn a combined interest of up to 1% per annum (yearly interest expressed as a percentage of your balance) on the first S$1,200,000 of your savings balance. At present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account\nAI: Your address on file is {{data-f62cb908}} 🏠, and your current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟. Regarding the interest rate for your savings account, at present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\nUser: What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account. Can you show me how to replace a credit card. Also i demand change my address.\nAI: Your address on file is {{data-c7f6ec3e}} 🏠.\n\nYour current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟.\n\nRegarding the interest rate for your savings account, at present, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate for its Savings Account.\n\nAccess your Horizon App account.\n\nNavigate to the 'Card Management' section.\n\nChoose the 'Replace Current Card' option.\n\nIndicate that your card is damaged to complete the request.\n\nSign in to the Horizon App.\n\nTap the Profile icon located at the upper-right corner.\n\nWithin Profile, navigate to Settings ► Personal Details.\n\nChoose the field you wish to modify (address, phone number, or email), and provide your Horizon Key for additional verification before the update is applied. Address updates take effect instantly.\n\nIf you'd like to skip the manual steps, you can also update your address or manage your cards directly using the shortcuts below.\nUser: thank you,, that was very informative\nAI: You're very welcome! 😊 Let me know if you need assistance with anything else.\nUser: can you explain the credit card replace part in more details?\nAI: Here are the detailed steps to obtain a replacement card if your Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage or if you need to replace it:\n\nAccess your Horizon App account.\n\nNavigate to the 'Card Management' section.\n\nChoose the 'Replace Current Card' option.\n\nIndicate that your card is damaged to complete the request.\n\nAdditionally, for a card that is lost or stolen, you can first freeze it by opening the card dashboard in the Horizon App, choosing \"View & Manage Card,\" and tapping \"Freeze Card\" followed by \"Order Replacement.\" Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one. Please note that the new card will arrive with a different card number, so be sure to update any recurring payments or subscriptions with the new details.\nUser: is your manage card can directly mange my card?\nAI: Yes, the card management feature in the Horizon App allows you to directly manage your card 💳. Depending on your needs, you can instantly lock or unlock your card, adjust payment preferences, or request a replacement if your card has been damaged or needs to be replaced. If you'd like to skip the manual steps, you can also manage your cards directly using the shortcut below.\nUser: is the shortcut directly to the same page of horizon app card management?\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"Access the card management dashboard by selecting the direct shortcut link provided in the app interface.\", \"policy\": \"Shortcut links are verified secure entry points that redirect users to the official card management page.\", \"conceptual\": \"The card management page serves as the centralized hub for all credit card maintenance and service requests.\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Horizon_APP\", \"target_intent\": [\"General Inquiries\"], \"customer_component\": \"Confirm if the provided shortcut link directs to the same card management page within the Horizon App.\", \"direct_query\": \"Confirm if the provided shortcut link directs to the same card management page within the Horizon App.\", \"subquery_id\": \"subquery_1\", \"angle_groups\": [{\"group_id\": \"base\", \"procedural\": \"Access the card management dashboard by selecting the direct shortcut link provided in the app interface.\", \"policy\": \"Shortcut links are verified secure entry points that redirect users to the official card management page.\", \"conceptual\": \"The card management page serves as the centralized hub for all credit card maintenance and service requests.\"}]}, \"retained_partial_parent_ids\": [], \"prior_sufficiency_audit_history\": [], \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_a12466ec\", \"content\": \"Question: Where can I locate my Scratch card within the Horizon App?\\n\\nAnswer: - Open the Horizon App, navigate to the Rewards area, and tap on Quests to view your Scratch card.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_717608ab\", \"content\": \"Question: In which section of the Horizon App should I enter my referral code?\\n\\nAnswer: - Launch the Horizon App, pick your preferred language, and tap “Get started” to begin the onboarding process.\\n- When prompted, type in your referral code.\\n- After completing registration, the referral bonus will be credited to your account.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_c85dae7e\", \"content\": \"Question: What benefits and capabilities come with the Horizon Link credit card?\\n\\nAnswer: - **Reward programme**: Earn the highest points on FairPrice Group grocery and food purchases. See the Horizon App for details on union and non‑union member tiers – subject to standard terms and conditions.\\n- **Zero‑fee structure**: No annual fee, no foreign‑currency surcharge and no over‑limit penalties.\\n- **Customisable repayment**: Select a due‑date that works for you and settle the balance at your convenience.\\n- **Enhanced online security**: {{faq_c85dae7e_001}}D Secure verification is built into the Horizon App for safer e‑commerce transactions.\\n- **Personal security controls**: Instantly lock or unlock your card and adjust payment preferences directly from the app.\\n- **Card pairing**: Seamlessly link your Horizon Link credit card with your Horizon debit card to switch between credit and savings accounts as needed.\\n- **Instant digital card issuance**: Receive a virtual card in the Horizon App immediately, ready for online and contactless purchases via Apple Pay or Google Pay.\\n- **NFC‑enabled physical activation**: Tap the back of your phone to the card for one‑click activation – a first in Singapore.\\n- **Real‑time rewards tracking**: Monitor your Linkpoints as you spend, with instant updates in the app.\\n- **Spending insights**: View categorized expenses and an overall spending summary in one dashboard.\\n- **Spend monitoring tool**: Keep tabs on your purchasing habits through the built‑in tracker.\\n- **Secure PIN setup**: Choose a six‑digit PIN within the Horizon App to protect ATM withdrawals.\\n- **Numberless card feature**: The card number is hidden and can be accessed securely via the app, reducing fraud risk.\\n- **Eco‑friendly design**: Card is manufactured from recycled ocean plastic, and the welcome pack uses recycled paper to minimise environmental impact.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Each Task Input contain