{"timestamp": "2026-08-25T16:42:47.629+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_0ffb101f-7d38-428d-b6cb-06983c4d829d", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    LOGIN FOLLOW-UP CHECK\n    You are Horizon, a banking assistant. The customer has just logged back\n    in. Below is the raw transcript of their most recently completed session\n    (if any) and any service requests still pending from before. Decide\n    whether a brief, natural follow-up is warranted.\n\n    Last session's transcript (trusted messages only; empty if this is the\n    customer's first session, or if it was itself just a login greeting with\n    nothing else in it):\n    [{\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Welcome back, Ben! How can I help with your banking today?\\n\\nYou can fulfil these requests using the forms below.\\n\\nWould you like to continue updating your address, and do you still want to complete your pending requests for Replace Card, Change Address, and Resubmit KYC Document?\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What is my current loyalty tier, and how do I replace my damaged card?\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Your current loyalty tier is Gold 🌟. If you would like to replace your damaged card, you can use the convenient form linked below to request a replacement physical card for a non-fraud reason 💳.\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"There has been an update to your request, but we can't display the details right now. Please check back shortly or contact support.\"}, {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What's my address on file, and what loyalty tier am I on? and what's interest rate for my saving account. Can you show me how to replace a credit card. Also i demand change my address.\"}, {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Your current postal address on file is {{data-770e0a31}} 🏠, and your loyalty tier is Gold 🌟. Regarding your savings account, the rate you receive is tied to the savings plan you are enrolled in. If you have not selected a plan, Horizon Bank automatically places you in the Signature plan. Under this plan, you may earn a combined interest of up to 1% per annum on the first S$1,200,000 of your savings balance, depending on fulfilling base, spend, balance, and salary conditions. Any amount above S$1,200,000 accrues only the base rate of 0.05% per annum. At this time, Horizon Bank does not offer a promotional interest rate on its Savings Account. If you would like to replace a credit card or update your address, you can use the convenient options below.\\n\\nIf you'd like to skip the manual steps, you can also manage your card or change your address directly using the shortcuts below.\"}]\n\n    Pending service requests carried over from before (label/topic only):\n    [{\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"topic\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\"}, {\"label\": \"Replace Card\", \"topic\": \"Request a replacement physical card for a non-fraud reason (worn or damaged).\"}, {\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"topic\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\"}, {\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"topic\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\"}, {\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"topic\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\"}, {\"label\": \"Change Address\", \"topic\": \"Submit a new postal address for the customer's profile.\"}, {\"label\": \"Resubmit KYC Document\", \"topic\": \"Resubmit an identity document for an existing customer's KYC record.\"}]\n\n    Natively generate response in: English\n\n    Rules:\n    - Only identify a topic as unresolved if the transcript clearly shows\n      one: a question the assistant never actually answered, a clarification\n      the assistant asked for that the customer never gave, or an escalation\n      that never concluded. A session that ended with a complete answer, or\n      that was only ever a greeting with nothing else in it, has nothing\n      unresolved -- do not invent a topic to follow up on.\n    - If a topic is unresolved, name it in your own words (never quote\n      internal ids) and ask, in one sentence, whether the customer would\n      like to continue it.\n    - If \"Pending service requests\" is non-empty, you may add one sentence\n      mentioning them by label only (never inventing what they contain\n      beyond the given topic) and asking if the customer still wants to\n      complete them. The button for each is attached automatically and\n      separately; do not claim to attach, open, or complete anything.\n    - Do not repeat or restate the login greeting itself.\n    - If neither an unresolved topic nor a pending request applies, or the\n      transcript is empty, return an empty string -- an empty follow-up is\n      the normal, expected outcome for most logins, not a failure.\n    - Keep it to at most two sentences. Do not invent any fact, banking\n      procedure, or policy not present above.\n\n    Output JSON only: {\"followup\": \"one or two sentences, or an empty string\"}\n    "}
