confined to\n    one can be corrected without discarding the other.\n    \n\n    Customer-Facing Content:\n    \n    Customer-Facing Answer:\n    \"Hello Ben! I'd be happy to help answer your question about your credit card fees.\n\nAs a valued Horizon Bank customer, you can enjoy zero-fee privileges as a permanent feature of your account! 💳 This means there is no annual fee, foreign transaction fee, card replacement fee, or overlimit fee on your credit card. 🎉\n\nIf you ever need details regarding potential late payment charges, you can visit our dedicated webpage for more information.\"\n\n    Customer-Facing Clarification:\n    \"\"\n\n    Complete Customer-Facing UI Payload:\n    \"{\"uiType\": \"blocks\", \"options\": [], \"stepDetails\": [], \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"items\": [], \"extendedText\": \"\", \"listClarificationText\": \"\", \"responseBlocks\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"contextText\": \"Hello Ben! I'd be happy to help answer your question about your credit card fees.\", \"text\": \"As a valued Horizon Bank customer, you can enjoy zero-fee privileges as a permanent feature of your account! 💳 This means there is no annual fee, foreign transaction fee, card replacement fee, or overlimit fee on your credit card. 🎉\\n\\nIf you ever need details regarding potential late payment charges, you can visit our dedicated webpage for more information.\", \"items\": [], \"options\": [], \"progressTitle\": \"\", \"stepDetails\": [], \"currentStep\": null, \"totalSteps\": null, \"listTitle\": \"\", \"listIntro\": \"\", \"extendedText\": \"\"}]}\"\n    \n\n    TASK: Assess CONDUCT & COMPLIANCE ONLY. Do not assess whether facts are\n    supported by evidence — a separate auditor handles that.\n\n\n    Output JSON only:\n    {\"conduct_compliant\": true/false, \"reason\": \"...\", \"conduct_violations\": [{\"rule\": \"bank_conduct\" | \"regulation\", \"violation\": \"...\", \"unsupported_content\": [\"verbatim phrase\"]}], \"answer_compliant\": true/false, \"clarification_compliant\": true/false, \"rewrite_instruction\": \"...\"}\n    "}
